window.HOT100_PROBLEMS=[{"order":1,"category":"哈希","id":"1","title":"两数之和","slug":"two-sum","difficulty":"EASY","pattern":"边遍历边查表","tags":["数组","哈希表"],"summary":"在数组中找到两个下标，使对应元素之和等于目标值；每个元素最多使用一次。","signal":"要求返回配对下标，且需要把二重循环降为线性时间。","invariant":"扫描到 x 时，哈希表只保存它左侧元素的“值 → 下标”；若 target-x 已出现，答案立即确定。","steps":["先建立“我还缺多少”的视角","遍历当前值前查询补数是否出现","未命中时再把当前值写入表，避免同一元素使用两次"],"time":"O(n)","space":"O(n)","pitfall":"必须先查再存；若先存，target=2x 时可能把同一位置配给自己。","formula":"x+(target-x)=target","code":"class Solution:\n    def twoSum(self, nums, target):\n        seen = {}\n        for i, x in enumerate(nums):\n            need = target - x\n            if need in seen:\n                return [seen[need], i]\n            seen[x] = i"},{"order":2,"category":"哈希","id":"49","title":"字母异位词分组","slug":"group-anagrams","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"规范化键分桶","tags":["数组","哈希表","字符串"],"summary":"把由相同字符以不同顺序组成的字符串归入同一组。","signal":"“顺序无关、组成相同”通常意味着构造唯一规范化键。","invariant":"两个字符串属于同组，当且仅当 26 个字母的频次数组完全相同。","steps":["为每个字符串统计 26 维计数","把不可哈希的列表转为元组作为键","同键字符串追加到同一个桶"],"time":"O(nk)","space":"O(nk)","pitfall":"不能直接用列表作字典键；题目若含非小写字母，应改用排序键或 Counter。","formula":"","code":"from collections import defaultdict\n\nclass Solution:\n    def groupAnagrams(self, strs):\n        groups = defaultdict(list)\n        for word in strs:\n            count = [0] * 26\n            for ch in word:\n                count[ord(ch) - ord(\"a\")] += 1\n            groups[tuple(count)].append(word)\n        return list(groups.values())"},{"order":3,"category":"哈希","id":"128","title":"最长连续序列","slug":"longest-consecutive-sequence","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"集合找序列起点","tags":["数组","哈希集合"],"summary":"在未排序数组中找最长的连续整数序列长度，要求总体线性复杂度。","signal":"要求 O(n)，又只关心元素是否存在而非顺序。","invariant":"只从不存在 x-1 的数 x 开始向右扩展；这样每个连续段只会被扫描一次。","steps":["把数组放入集合去重","枚举集合并筛选连续段起点","从起点递增计数并更新最大长度"],"time":"O(n)","space":"O(n)","pitfall":"若从每个数都向右扩展，连续数组会退化为 O(n²)。","formula":"","code":"class Solution:\n    def longestConsecutive(self, nums):\n        values = set(nums)\n        best = 0\n        for x in values:\n            if x - 1 not in values:\n                length = 1\n                while x + length in values:\n                    length += 1\n                best = max(best, length)\n        return best"},{"order":4,"category":"双指针","id":"283","title":"移动零","slug":"move-zeroes","difficulty":"EASY","pattern":"快慢指针稳定压缩","tags":["数组","双指针"],"summary":"原地把所有 0 移到数组末尾，并保持非零元素相对顺序。","signal":"“原地删除某类元素并保持顺序”优先想到快慢指针。","invariant":"慢指针始终指向下一个非零元素应放置的位置；快指针负责发现非零元素。","steps":["快指针扫描全部元素","遇到非零就写到慢指针并前移","扫描结束后把剩余位置补零"],"time":"O(n)","space":"O(1)","pitfall":"只交换也可实现，但写入后补零更容易证明稳定性。","formula":"","code":"class Solution:\n    def moveZeroes(self, nums):\n        write = 0\n        for x in nums:\n            if x != 0:\n                nums[write] = x\n                write += 1\n        while write < len(nums):\n            nums[write] = 0\n            write += 1"},{"order":5,"category":"双指针","id":"11","title":"盛最多水的容器","slug":"container-with-most-water","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"短板侧收缩","tags":["数组","双指针","贪心"],"summary":"选择两条竖线，使它们与横轴围成的容器盛水最多。","signal":"面积由宽度与较短高度决定，暴力枚举是 O(n²)。","invariant":"当前宽度缩小时，只有移动短板才可能提高有效高度；移动长板不可能得到更大面积。","steps":["左右指针从两端开始","用短板乘宽度更新答案","移动较短一侧，若等高可移动任意一侧"],"time":"O(n)","space":"O(1)","pitfall":"面积高度必须取 min；不要被更高的那条边误导。","formula":"A=(r-l)\\min(h_l,h_r)","code":"class Solution:\n    def maxArea(self, height):\n        left, right = 0, len(height) - 1\n        answer = 0\n        while left < right:\n            answer = max(answer, (right - left) * min(height[left], height[right]))\n            if height[left] < height[right]:\n                left += 1\n            else:\n                right -= 1\n        return answer"},{"order":6,"category":"双指针","id":"15","title":"三数之和","slug":"3sum","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"排序加双指针去重","tags":["数组","双指针","排序"],"summary":"找出所有和为 0 且不重复的三元组。","signal":"三元组求和并要求去重，常用排序固定一项再做两数之和。","invariant":"固定 nums[i] 后，区间内和随左指针右移而增大、随右指针左移而减小。","steps":["排序数组并枚举第一个数","用左右指针寻找另外两数","在固定项和命中后分别跳过重复值"],"time":"O(n²)","space":"O(1)（不计结果）","pitfall":"去重必须比较值而不是下标；nums[i]>0 后可直接结束。","formula":"a+b+c=0","code":"class Solution:\n    def threeSum(self, nums):\n        nums.sort()\n        answer = []\n        for i in range(len(nums) - 2):\n            if nums[i] > 0:\n                break\n            if i and nums[i] == nums[i - 1]:\n                continue\n            left, right = i + 1, len(nums) - 1\n            while left < right:\n                total = nums[i] + nums[left] + nums[right]\n                if total < 0:\n                    left += 1\n                elif total > 0:\n                    right -= 1\n                else:\n                    answer.append([nums[i], nums[left], nums[right]])\n                    left += 1\n                    right -= 1\n                    while left < right and nums[left] == nums[left - 1]:\n                        left += 1\n                    while left < right and nums[right] == nums[right + 1]:\n                        right -= 1\n        return answer"},{"order":7,"category":"双指针","id":"42","title":"接雨水","slug":"trapping-rain-water","difficulty":"HARD","pattern":"左右最大值夹逼","tags":["数组","双指针"],"summary":"给定柱高，计算下雨后能接住的总水量。","signal":"每格水量由左侧最高柱与右侧最高柱的较小者决定。","invariant":"当 left_max≤right_max 时，左端水位已由 left_max 确定，不需要知道右侧更精确的最大值。","steps":["维护左右指针及两侧历史最高柱","比较两侧最高值并结算较小一侧","移动已结算侧直至相遇"],"time":"O(n)","space":"O(1)","pitfall":"比较的是两侧最大值而非当前柱高；先更新最大值再计算不会产生负数。","formula":"water_i=\\max(0,\\min(L_i,R_i)-h_i)","code":"class Solution:\n    def trap(self, height):\n        left, right = 0, len(height) - 1\n        left_max = right_max = water = 0\n        while left <= right:\n            if left_max <= right_max:\n                left_max = max(left_max, height[left])\n                water += left_max - height[left]\n                left += 1\n            else:\n                right_max = max(right_max, height[right])\n                water += right_max - height[right]\n                right -= 1\n        return water"},{"order":8,"category":"滑动窗口","id":"3","title":"无重复字符的最长子串","slug":"longest-substring-without-repeating-characters","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"可变长滑动窗口","tags":["哈希表","字符串","滑动窗口"],"summary":"求不含重复字符的最长连续子串长度。","signal":"“最长连续区间 + 区间内满足某性质”通常用滑动窗口。","invariant":"窗口 [left,right] 内始终没有重复字符；left 只向右移动。","steps":["记录每个字符最近出现位置","发现窗口内重复时把 left 跳到上次位置后一位","每轮更新窗口长度"],"time":"O(n)","space":"O(字符集)","pitfall":"left 必须取 max(left,last[ch]+1)，避免被窗口外的旧位置拉回。","formula":"length=right-left+1","code":"class Solution:\n    def lengthOfLongestSubstring(self, s):\n        last = {}\n        left = answer = 0\n        for right, ch in enumerate(s):\n            if ch in last:\n                left = max(left, last[ch] + 1)\n            last[ch] = right\n            answer = max(answer, right - left + 1)\n        return answer"},{"order":9,"category":"滑动窗口","id":"438","title":"找到字符串中所有字母异位词","slug":"find-all-anagrams-in-a-string","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"定长滑动窗口计数","tags":["字符串","滑动窗口","计数"],"summary":"返回 s 中所有与 p 互为字母异位词的子串起点。","signal":"目标子串长度固定为 len(p)，适合定长窗口。","invariant":"窗口始终保持长度不超过 len(p)，命中条件是窗口计数与目标计数完全相同。","steps":["统计 p 的字符频次","右移加入字符，超长时从左侧移出","窗口等长且计数一致时记录左端点"],"time":"O(n·Σ) 或 O(n)","space":"O(Σ)","pitfall":"Counter 比较写法清晰但会有字符集比较常数；面试可进一步维护差异计数。","formula":"","code":"from collections import Counter\n\nclass Solution:\n    def findAnagrams(self, s, p):\n        need = Counter(p)\n        window = Counter()\n        answer = []\n        left = 0\n        for right, ch in enumerate(s):\n            window[ch] += 1\n            if right - left + 1 > len(p):\n                old = s[left]\n                window[old] -= 1\n                if window[old] == 0:\n                    del window[old]\n                left += 1\n            if window == need:\n                answer.append(left)\n        return answer"},{"order":10,"category":"子串","id":"560","title":"和为 K 的子数组","slug":"subarray-sum-equals-k","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"前缀和频次","tags":["数组","哈希表","前缀和"],"summary":"统计和恰好为 k 的连续子数组数量。","signal":"存在负数时滑动窗口不具单调性；区间和应转成两个前缀和之差。","invariant":"到当前位置的前缀和为 s，需要此前出现过 s-k；出现多少次就新增多少个答案。","steps":["初始化前缀和 0 出现一次","累加当前前缀和并查询 s-k 的频次","再把当前前缀和计入哈希表"],"time":"O(n)","space":"O(n)","pitfall":"必须先查询再增加当前前缀和；初始 {0:1} 用于统计从下标 0 开始的区间。","formula":"sum(i..j)=P_j-P_{i-1}=k","code":"from collections import defaultdict\n\nclass Solution:\n    def subarraySum(self, nums, k):\n        count = defaultdict(int)\n        count[0] = 1\n        prefix = answer = 0\n        for x in nums:\n            prefix += x\n            answer += count[prefix - k]\n            count[prefix] += 1\n        return answer"},{"order":11,"category":"子串","id":"239","title":"滑动窗口最大值","slug":"sliding-window-maximum","difficulty":"HARD","pattern":"单调队列","tags":["数组","队列","滑动窗口"],"summary":"返回每个长度为 k 的滑动窗口中的最大值。","signal":"窗口不断右移并频繁查询最大值，普通队列无法 O(1) 得到最大值。","invariant":"双端队列保存“值严格递减”的候选下标；队首永远是当前窗口最大值。","steps":["移除已经滑出左边界的队首","从队尾删除不大于当前值的无用候选","加入当前下标，窗口形成后记录队首值"],"time":"O(n)","space":"O(k)","pitfall":"队列要存下标而非值，才能判断元素是否过期。","formula":"","code":"from collections import deque\n\nclass Solution:\n    def maxSlidingWindow(self, nums, k):\n        queue = deque()\n        answer = []\n        for i, x in enumerate(nums):\n            while queue and queue[0] <= i - k:\n                queue.popleft()\n            while queue and nums[queue[-1]] <= x:\n                queue.pop()\n            queue.append(i)\n            if i >= k - 1:\n                answer.append(nums[queue[0]])\n        return answer"},{"order":12,"category":"子串","id":"76","title":"最小覆盖子串","slug":"minimum-window-substring","difficulty":"HARD","pattern":"满足后尽量收缩","tags":["字符串","哈希表","滑动窗口"],"summary":"在 s 中寻找包含 t 全部字符（含重复次数）的最短子串。","signal":"“最短连续区间 + 至少满足需求”使用先扩张、满足后收缩的窗口。","invariant":"formed 表示已经达到目标频次的字符种类数；formed 等于 need 的键数时窗口才完整。","steps":["统计 t 的需求频次","右移扩张并在频次刚好达标时增加 formed","满足后反复左移，记录最短窗口并维护 formed"],"time":"O(n+m)","space":"O(Σ)","pitfall":"formed 统计的是达标字符种类，不是窗口字符总数；移出字符后低于需求才失效。","formula":"","code":"from collections import Counter, defaultdict\n\nclass Solution:\n    def minWindow(self, s, t):\n        if not t:\n            return \"\"\n        need = Counter(t)\n        window = defaultdict(int)\n        formed = left = 0\n        best_len, best_left = float(\"inf\"), 0\n        for right, ch in enumerate(s):\n            window[ch] += 1\n            if ch in need and window[ch] == need[ch]:\n                formed += 1\n            while formed == len(need):\n                if right - left + 1 < best_len:\n                    best_len, best_left = right - left + 1, left\n                old = s[left]\n                window[old] -= 1\n                if old in need and window[old] < need[old]:\n                    formed -= 1\n                left += 1\n        return \"\" if best_len == float(\"inf\") else s[best_left:best_left + best_len]"},{"order":13,"category":"普通数组","id":"53","title":"最大子数组和","slug":"maximum-subarray","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"Kadane 动态规划","tags":["数组","动态规划"],"summary":"求连续子数组能取得的最大和。","signal":"“连续、最大和”可判断前缀贡献是否值得保留。","invariant":"以当前位置结尾的最大和，只可能是当前数本身，或接在前一位置的最优结尾之后。","steps":["用 cur 表示必须以当前元素结尾的最优值","每步在重新开始与继续累加之间选择","用 best 保存全局最大值"],"time":"O(n)","space":"O(1)","pitfall":"答案不能初始化为 0，否则全负数组会出错。","formula":"f_i=\\max(x_i,f_{i-1}+x_i)","code":"class Solution:\n    def maxSubArray(self, nums):\n        current = best = nums[0]\n        for x in nums[1:]:\n            current = max(x, current + x)\n            best = max(best, current)\n        return best"},{"order":14,"category":"普通数组","id":"56","title":"合并区间","slug":"merge-intervals","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"按左端点排序扫描","tags":["数组","排序"],"summary":"合并所有互相重叠的闭区间。","signal":"区间问题常先按起点排序，让可能重叠的区间相邻。","invariant":"已合并结果的最后一个区间覆盖了此前所有区间；新起点不大于其终点时必须合并。","steps":["按左端点升序排序","逐个与结果尾区间比较","重叠就扩张终点，否则开启新区间"],"time":"O(n log n)","space":"O(n)（结果）","pitfall":"闭区间 [1,4] 与 [4,5] 也重叠；合并终点要取 max。","formula":"","code":"class Solution:\n    def merge(self, intervals):\n        intervals.sort(key=lambda pair: pair[0])\n        merged = []\n        for start, end in intervals:\n            if not merged or start > merged[-1][1]:\n                merged.append([start, end])\n            else:\n                merged[-1][1] = max(merged[-1][1], end)\n        return merged"},{"order":15,"category":"普通数组","id":"189","title":"轮转数组","slug":"rotate-array","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"三次反转","tags":["数组","双指针"],"summary":"将数组向右轮转 k 个位置，要求原地修改。","signal":"轮转等价于把尾部 k 个元素搬到最前面。","invariant":"整体反转后，两段的顺序都相反；分别反转前 k 段和剩余段即可恢复各自内部顺序。","steps":["先令 k 对 n 取模","反转整个数组","分别反转 [0,k) 与 [k,n)"],"time":"O(n)","space":"O(1)","pitfall":"空数组要避免取模除零；Python 切片虽短但会使用额外空间。","formula":"","code":"class Solution:\n    def rotate(self, nums, k):\n        n = len(nums)\n        k %= n\n\n        def reverse(left, right):\n            while left < right:\n                nums[left], nums[right] = nums[right], nums[left]\n                left += 1\n                right -= 1\n\n        reverse(0, n - 1)\n        reverse(0, k - 1)\n        reverse(k, n - 1)"},{"order":16,"category":"普通数组","id":"238","title":"除了自身以外数组的乘积","slug":"product-of-array-except-self","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"前后缀乘积","tags":["数组","前缀积"],"summary":"返回每个位置之外所有元素的乘积，不能使用除法。","signal":"“排除当前位置”的聚合可拆成左侧贡献与右侧贡献。","invariant":"答案 i 等于 i 左侧全部乘积乘以 i 右侧全部乘积。","steps":["正向把左侧乘积写入答案","反向维护右侧乘积并乘到答案上","每次先使用再更新当前元素"],"time":"O(n)","space":"O(1)（不计输出）","pitfall":"不要先更新 right 再乘，否则会把 nums[i] 自己算进去。","formula":"ans_i=(\\prod_{j<i}x_j)(\\prod_{j>i}x_j)","code":"class Solution:\n    def productExceptSelf(self, nums):\n        answer = [1] * len(nums)\n        prefix = 1\n        for i, x in enumerate(nums):\n            answer[i] = prefix\n            prefix *= x\n        suffix = 1\n        for i in range(len(nums) - 1, -1, -1):\n            answer[i] *= suffix\n            suffix *= nums[i]\n        return answer"},{"order":17,"category":"普通数组","id":"41","title":"缺失的第一个正数","slug":"first-missing-positive","difficulty":"HARD","pattern":"原地哈希归位","tags":["数组","原地交换"],"summary":"在线性时间、常数额外空间内找数组中缺失的最小正整数。","signal":"答案一定落在 [1,n+1]，可把数组下标当作哈希槽。","invariant":"若值 x 在 [1,n]，它最终应被放到下标 x-1；归位后首个不匹配槽给出答案。","steps":["遍历每个位置，把合法且未就位的值反复交换到目标槽","再次扫描寻找 nums[i]≠i+1","若全匹配返回 n+1"],"time":"O(n)","space":"O(1)","pitfall":"交换循环必须判断目标槽值不同，否则重复元素会导致死循环。","formula":"","code":"class Solution:\n    def firstMissingPositive(self, nums):\n        n = len(nums)\n        for i in range(n):\n            while 1 <= nums[i] <= n and nums[nums[i] - 1] != nums[i]:\n                target = nums[i] - 1\n                nums[i], nums[target] = nums[target], nums[i]\n        for i, x in enumerate(nums):\n            if x != i + 1:\n                return i + 1\n        return n + 1"},{"order":18,"category":"矩阵","id":"73","title":"矩阵置零","slug":"set-matrix-zeroes","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"首行首列作标记","tags":["矩阵","原地标记"],"summary":"若某元素为 0，把它所在整行和整列都置 0，要求原地完成。","signal":"需要行列标记但空间要求严格，可复用矩阵首行与首列。","invariant":"matrix[i][0] 和 matrix[0][j] 记录内部单元的行列是否应清零；首列状态需单独保存。","steps":["先记录首列是否含零","扫描内部区域并写入行列标记","倒序根据标记清零，最后处理首列"],"time":"O(mn)","space":"O(1)","pitfall":"倒序处理可避免首行标记过早被改坏；首行由 matrix[0][0] 统一控制。","formula":"","code":"class Solution:\n    def setZeroes(self, matrix):\n        rows, cols = len(matrix), len(matrix[0])\n        first_col_zero = any(matrix[r][0] == 0 for r in range(rows))\n        for r in range(rows):\n            for c in range(1, cols):\n                if matrix[r][c] == 0:\n                    matrix[r][0] = matrix[0][c] = 0\n        for r in range(rows - 1, -1, -1):\n            for c in range(cols - 1, 0, -1):\n                if matrix[r][0] == 0 or matrix[0][c] == 0:\n                    matrix[r][c] = 0\n            if first_col_zero:\n                matrix[r][0] = 0"},{"order":19,"category":"矩阵","id":"54","title":"螺旋矩阵","slug":"spiral-matrix","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"收缩四边界","tags":["矩阵","模拟"],"summary":"按顺时针螺旋顺序返回矩阵全部元素。","signal":"逐层遍历矩形边框，访问后收缩边界。","invariant":"未访问区域始终由 top、bottom、left、right 四条边界准确描述。","steps":["依次遍历上边与右边并收缩","若仍有剩余，再遍历下边与左边","直到边界交错"],"time":"O(mn)","space":"O(1)（不计输出）","pitfall":"遍历下边和左边前必须再次检查边界，否则单行或单列会重复加入。","formula":"","code":"class Solution:\n    def spiralOrder(self, matrix):\n        if not matrix:\n            return []\n        top, bottom = 0, len(matrix) - 1\n        left, right = 0, len(matrix[0]) - 1\n        answer = []\n        while top <= bottom and left <= right:\n            answer.extend(matrix[top][left:right + 1])\n            top += 1\n            for r in range(top, bottom + 1):\n                answer.append(matrix[r][right])\n            right -= 1\n            if top <= bottom:\n                answer.extend(reversed(matrix[bottom][left:right + 1]))\n                bottom -= 1\n            if left <= right:\n                for r in range(bottom, top - 1, -1):\n                    answer.append(matrix[r][left])\n                left += 1\n        return answer"},{"order":20,"category":"矩阵","id":"48","title":"旋转图像","slug":"rotate-image","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"转置再反转每行","tags":["矩阵","原地变换"],"summary":"将 n×n 矩阵原地顺时针旋转 90°。","signal":"旋转可拆成容易原地执行的对称变换。","invariant":"先沿主对角线转置，再水平翻转每一行，位置 (i,j) 最终到 (j,n-1-i)。","steps":["仅交换主对角线上方元素完成转置","逐行双指针反转","原矩阵即为旋转结果"],"time":"O(n²)","space":"O(1)","pitfall":"转置循环 j 要从 i+1 开始，避免一对元素交换两次。","formula":"(i,j)\\mapsto(j,n-1-i)","code":"class Solution:\n    def rotate(self, matrix):\n        n = len(matrix)\n        for r in range(n):\n            for c in range(r + 1, n):\n                matrix[r][c], matrix[c][r] = matrix[c][r], matrix[r][c]\n        for row in matrix:\n            row.reverse()"},{"order":21,"category":"矩阵","id":"240","title":"搜索二维矩阵 II","slug":"search-a-2d-matrix-ii","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"右上角阶梯搜索","tags":["矩阵","二分性质"],"summary":"在每行递增、每列递增的矩阵中查找目标值。","signal":"选右上角后，向左变小、向下变大，每次比较能排除一行或一列。","invariant":"当前位置大于目标时整列下方都更大，可左移；小于目标时整行左侧都更小，可下移。","steps":["从右上角开始","等于目标立即返回","按大小关系左移或下移，越界则不存在"],"time":"O(m+n)","space":"O(1)","pitfall":"从左上角出发不能唯一决定方向；矩阵为空时先返回。","formula":"","code":"class Solution:\n    def searchMatrix(self, matrix, target):\n        if not matrix or not matrix[0]:\n            return False\n        row, col = 0, len(matrix[0]) - 1\n        while row < len(matrix) and col >= 0:\n            value = matrix[row][col]\n            if value == target:\n                return True\n            if value > target:\n                col -= 1\n            else:\n                row += 1\n        return False"},{"order":22,"category":"链表","id":"160","title":"相交链表","slug":"intersection-of-two-linked-lists","difficulty":"EASY","pattern":"双指针消除长度差","tags":["链表","双指针"],"summary":"找两个单链表开始相交的节点；相交按节点引用而非值判断。","signal":"两条路径长度不同，可让指针各自走完 A+B 与 B+A。","invariant":"交换链表头后，两指针经过的总路程相同，若相交会在公共节点同步，否则同时到 None。","steps":["pa 与 pb 分别从两表头出发","到尾后切换到另一表头","两指针相同即返回"],"time":"O(m+n)","space":"O(1)","pitfall":"比较节点对象身份，不能比较节点值。","formula":"","code":"class Solution:\n    def getIntersectionNode(self, headA, headB):\n        a, b = headA, headB\n        while a is not b:\n            a = a.next if a else headB\n            b = b.next if b else headA\n        return a"},{"order":23,"category":"链表","id":"206","title":"反转链表","slug":"reverse-linked-list","difficulty":"EASY","pattern":"三指针迭代","tags":["链表","指针"],"summary":"反转单链表并返回新头节点。","signal":"改变 next 指向时必须先保存尚未访问的后继。","invariant":"prev 始终是已经反转完成的链表头，cur 是下一待处理节点。","steps":["保存 nxt=cur.next","把 cur.next 指向 prev","prev、cur 同步前进，最终返回 prev"],"time":"O(n)","space":"O(1)","pitfall":"更新 cur 前若没保存 nxt，剩余链表会丢失。","formula":"","code":"class Solution:\n    def reverseList(self, head):\n        previous, current = None, head\n        while current:\n            nxt = current.next\n            current.next = previous\n            previous, current = current, nxt\n        return previous"},{"order":24,"category":"链表","id":"234","title":"回文链表","slug":"palindrome-linked-list","difficulty":"EASY","pattern":"中点加后半段反转","tags":["链表","快慢指针"],"summary":"判断单链表节点值序列是否为回文。","signal":"回文需要从两端比较，链表可通过快慢指针找到中点并反转后半段。","invariant":"慢指针抵达中点时，快指针走到末尾；反转后半段即可从两端同步比较。","steps":["快慢指针寻找中点","反转慢指针之后的链表","从头和反转头逐项比较"],"time":"O(n)","space":"O(1)","pitfall":"若业务要求保持输入不变，应在比较后再次反转恢复链表。","formula":"","code":"class Solution:\n    def isPalindrome(self, head):\n        slow = fast = head\n        while fast and fast.next:\n            slow = slow.next\n            fast = fast.next.next\n        previous = None\n        while slow:\n            nxt = slow.next\n            slow.next = previous\n            previous, slow = slow, nxt\n        left, right = head, previous\n        while right:\n            if left.val != right.val:\n                return False\n            left, right = left.next, right.next\n        return True"},{"order":25,"category":"链表","id":"141","title":"环形链表","slug":"linked-list-cycle","difficulty":"EASY","pattern":"Floyd 快慢指针","tags":["链表","快慢指针"],"summary":"判断链表中是否存在环。","signal":"指针若处于环内，速度差会让快指针追上慢指针。","invariant":"慢指针每次一步、快指针每次两步；有环必相遇，无环快指针先到 None。","steps":["同时启动快慢指针","循环检查快指针及其后继","相遇返回 True，退出循环返回 False"],"time":"O(n)","space":"O(1)","pitfall":"循环条件必须检查 fast 和 fast.next，避免访问空引用。","formula":"","code":"class Solution:\n    def hasCycle(self, head):\n        slow = fast = head\n        while fast and fast.next:\n            slow = slow.next\n            fast = fast.next.next\n            if slow is fast:\n                return True\n        return False"},{"order":26,"category":"链表","id":"142","title":"环形链表 II","slug":"linked-list-cycle-ii","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"相遇后同步找入口","tags":["链表","快慢指针"],"summary":"若链表有环，返回进入环的第一个节点。","signal":"Floyd 相遇后，从头与相遇点各放一个一步指针，它们会在入口相遇。","invariant":"设头到入口为 a、入口到相遇为 b、环剩余为 c，由快慢路程关系可得 a 与从相遇点绕到入口的距离同余。","steps":["先用快慢指针判断并得到相遇点","一个指针回到表头","两指针每次一步，下一相遇点即环入口"],"time":"O(n)","space":"O(1)","pitfall":"第二阶段两个指针都必须改为一步；无环时返回 None。","formula":"2(a+b)=a+b+k(b+c)","code":"class Solution:\n    def detectCycle(self, head):\n        slow = fast = head\n        while fast and fast.next:\n            slow = slow.next\n            fast = fast.next.next\n            if slow is fast:\n                seeker = head\n                while seeker is not slow:\n                    seeker = seeker.next\n                    slow = slow.next\n                return seeker\n        return None"},{"order":27,"category":"链表","id":"21","title":"合并两个有序链表","slug":"merge-two-sorted-lists","difficulty":"EASY","pattern":"哑节点串联","tags":["链表","双指针"],"summary":"合并两个非递减链表，返回新的有序链表。","signal":"两个序列已有序，只需不断选择较小头节点。","invariant":"tail 后面的链表始终为空，tail 之前已经是所有已处理节点的有序合并。","steps":["创建哑节点和尾指针","比较两链表当前节点并接入较小者","循环后直接接上未耗尽的链表"],"time":"O(m+n)","space":"O(1)","pitfall":"返回 dummy.next 而不是 dummy；可复用原节点，无需新建所有节点。","formula":"","code":"class Solution:\n    def mergeTwoLists(self, list1, list2):\n        dummy = ListNode()\n        tail = dummy\n        while list1 and list2:\n            if list1.val <= list2.val:\n                tail.next, list1 = list1, list1.next\n            else:\n                tail.next, list2 = list2, list2.next\n            tail = tail.next\n        tail.next = list1 or list2\n        return dummy.next"},{"order":28,"category":"链表","id":"2","title":"两数相加","slug":"add-two-numbers","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"逐位相加维护进位","tags":["链表","模拟"],"summary":"两个链表按逆序存储非负整数各位，返回它们的和。","signal":"与竖式加法相同，只需同步扫描并保存进位。","invariant":"每轮 total=x+y+carry，当前位为 total mod 10，新进位为 total div 10。","steps":["用哑节点构建结果","两表未结束或仍有进位时读取缺省 0","divmod 得到进位和当前位并追加节点"],"time":"O(max(m,n))","space":"O(max(m,n))（结果）","pitfall":"循环条件必须包含 carry，否则最高位进位会丢失。","formula":"digit=(x+y+c)\\bmod 10","code":"class Solution:\n    def addTwoNumbers(self, l1, l2):\n        dummy = ListNode()\n        tail, carry = dummy, 0\n        while l1 or l2 or carry:\n            x = l1.val if l1 else 0\n            y = l2.val if l2 else 0\n            carry, digit = divmod(x + y + carry, 10)\n            tail.next = ListNode(digit)\n            tail = tail.next\n            l1 = l1.next if l1 else None\n            l2 = l2.next if l2 else None\n        return dummy.next"},{"order":29,"category":"链表","id":"19","title":"删除链表的倒数第 N 个结点","slug":"remove-nth-node-from-end-of-list","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"前后间隔 n 的双指针","tags":["链表","双指针"],"summary":"删除链表倒数第 n 个节点并返回头节点。","signal":"不知道链表长度，但可让快指针领先慢指针固定距离。","invariant":"从哑节点出发，fast 比 slow 领先 n+1 步；fast 到 None 时 slow 正好位于待删节点前驱。","steps":["在头前创建哑节点","fast 先走 n+1 步","快慢同步到 fast 为空，再令 slow.next 跳过目标"],"time":"O(n)","space":"O(1)","pitfall":"使用哑节点可统一删除头节点；领先距离是 n+1 而不是 n。","formula":"","code":"class Solution:\n    def removeNthFromEnd(self, head, n):\n        dummy = ListNode(0, head)\n        fast = slow = dummy\n        for _ in range(n + 1):\n            fast = fast.next\n        while fast:\n            fast = fast.next\n            slow = slow.next\n        slow.next = slow.next.next\n        return dummy.next"},{"order":30,"category":"链表","id":"24","title":"两两交换链表中的节点","slug":"swap-nodes-in-pairs","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"按组改三条边","tags":["链表","指针"],"summary":"不修改节点值，两两交换相邻节点。","signal":"链表局部重排时先找每组前驱，按固定顺序改指针。","invariant":"prev 始终指向下一对节点之前，交换后移动到该对的新尾。","steps":["用哑节点指向头","取 a=prev.next 与 b=a.next","依次连接 prev→b、a→b.next、b→a，再推进 prev"],"time":"O(n)","space":"O(1)","pitfall":"先保存 b.next 或按安全顺序赋值，避免断链。","formula":"","code":"class Solution:\n    def swapPairs(self, head):\n        dummy = ListNode(0, head)\n        previous = dummy\n        while previous.next and previous.next.next:\n            first = previous.next\n            second = first.next\n            first.next = second.next\n            second.next = first\n            previous.next = second\n            previous = first\n        return dummy.next"},{"order":31,"category":"链表","id":"25","title":"K 个一组翻转链表","slug":"reverse-nodes-in-k-group","difficulty":"HARD","pattern":"定位组尾后局部反转","tags":["链表","分组反转"],"summary":"每 k 个节点一组翻转链表，不足 k 个保持原序。","signal":"先确认一组是否完整，再只反转这个闭区间。","invariant":"group_prev 后恰有 k 个节点时，反转 [group_prev.next, group_next) 并正确接回两端。","steps":["从组前驱向后找第 k 个节点","不足 k 个直接结束","以 group_next 为初始 prev 反转整组，再把组前驱移到旧组头"],"time":"O(n)","space":"O(1)","pitfall":"必须在反转前保存 group_next；旧组头翻转后会成为新组尾。","formula":"","code":"class Solution:\n    def reverseKGroup(self, head, k):\n        dummy = ListNode(0, head)\n        group_previous = dummy\n        while True:\n            kth = group_previous\n            for _ in range(k):\n                kth = kth.next\n                if not kth:\n                    return dummy.next\n            group_next = kth.next\n            previous, current = group_next, group_previous.next\n            while current is not group_next:\n                nxt = current.next\n                current.next = previous\n                previous, current = current, nxt\n            old_head = group_previous.next\n            group_previous.next = kth\n            group_previous = old_head"},{"order":32,"category":"链表","id":"138","title":"随机链表的复制","slug":"copy-list-with-random-pointer","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"原节点后穿插副本","tags":["链表","哈希映射"],"summary":"深拷贝带 next 与 random 指针的链表。","signal":"要建立原节点到副本的映射；可用哈希表，也可把副本穿插在原节点后。","invariant":"穿插后原节点 x 的副本恒为 x.next，因此副本 random 可由 x.random.next 得到。","steps":["在每个原节点后插入副本","第二遍设置副本 random","第三遍拆分原链表与副本链表"],"time":"O(n)","space":"O(1)（不计结果）","pitfall":"拆分时既要恢复原链表，也要正确连接副本的 next。","formula":"","code":"class Solution:\n    def copyRandomList(self, head):\n        current = head\n        while current:\n            clone = Node(current.val, current.next)\n            current.next = clone\n            current = clone.next\n        current = head\n        while current:\n            current.next.random = current.random.next if current.random else None\n            current = current.next.next\n        dummy = Node(0)\n        clone_tail = dummy\n        current = head\n        while current:\n            clone = current.next\n            current.next = clone.next\n            clone_tail.next = clone\n            clone_tail = clone\n            current = current.next\n        return dummy.next"},{"order":33,"category":"链表","id":"148","title":"排序链表","slug":"sort-list","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"链表归并排序","tags":["链表","分治","归并排序"],"summary":"在 O(n log n) 时间内对链表排序。","signal":"链表不支持随机访问，但拆分和有序归并都是 O(1) 额外指针操作。","invariant":"快慢指针把链表稳定分为两半；两半分别有序后可线性合并。","steps":["用快慢指针找到中点前驱并断开","递归排序左右两半","用哑节点合并两个有序链表"],"time":"O(n log n)","space":"O(log n) 递归栈","pitfall":"找中点时 fast 从 head.next 开始，可避免两节点链表无法缩小。","formula":"","code":"class Solution:\n    def sortList(self, head):\n        if not head or not head.next:\n            return head\n        slow, fast = head, head.next\n        while fast and fast.next:\n            slow = slow.next\n            fast = fast.next.next\n        right = slow.next\n        slow.next = None\n        left = self.sortList(head)\n        right = self.sortList(right)\n        dummy = ListNode()\n        tail = dummy\n        while left and right:\n            if left.val <= right.val:\n                tail.next, left = left, left.next\n            else:\n                tail.next, right = right, right.next\n            tail = tail.next\n        tail.next = left or right\n        return dummy.next"},{"order":34,"category":"链表","id":"23","title":"合并 K 个升序链表","slug":"merge-k-sorted-lists","difficulty":"HARD","pattern":"小根堆维护各表头","tags":["链表","堆","归并"],"summary":"合并 k 个有序链表为一个有序链表。","signal":"每次只需从 k 个当前表头中取最小值。","invariant":"堆中至多保存每条未耗尽链表的当前头；弹出最小节点后只把它的后继加入候选。","steps":["把所有非空表头连同唯一序号压入堆","反复弹出最小节点接到结果尾","若有后继则压入堆"],"time":"O(N log k)","space":"O(k)","pitfall":"Python 节点不可直接比较，堆元素需加入自增序号打破值相同的平局。","formula":"","code":"import heapq\nfrom itertools import count\n\nclass Solution:\n    def mergeKLists(self, lists):\n        heap = []\n        serial = count()\n        for node in lists:\n            if node:\n                heapq.heappush(heap, (node.val, next(serial), node))\n        dummy = ListNode()\n        tail = dummy\n        while heap:\n            _, _, node = heapq.heappop(heap)\n            tail.next = node\n            tail = node\n            if node.next:\n                heapq.heappush(heap, (node.next.val, next(serial), node.next))\n        return dummy.next"},{"order":35,"category":"链表","id":"146","title":"LRU 缓存","slug":"lru-cache","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"哈希表加双向链表","tags":["哈希表","双向链表","设计"],"summary":"实现 O(1) 的 get 和 put，并在超容量时淘汰最久未使用项。","signal":"哈希表支持 O(1) 定位，双向链表支持 O(1) 删除与移动节点。","invariant":"链表头侧表示最近使用，尾侧表示最久未使用；字典把 key 映射到节点。","steps":["get 命中后把节点移到头部","put 更新或新建并移到头部","超容量时删除尾哨兵前节点并同步删字典"],"time":"O(1) 每次操作","space":"O(capacity)","pitfall":"更新已有 key 也算一次使用；容量淘汰时字典和链表必须同步。","formula":"","code":"class Node:\n    def __init__(self, key=0, value=0):\n        self.key, self.value = key, value\n        self.prev = self.next = None\n\nclass LRUCache:\n    def __init__(self, capacity):\n        self.capacity = capacity\n        self.nodes = {}\n        self.head, self.tail = Node(), Node()\n        self.head.next, self.tail.prev = self.tail, self.head\n\n    def _remove(self, node):\n        node.prev.next, node.next.prev = node.next, node.prev\n\n    def _add_first(self, node):\n        node.next, node.prev = self.head.next, self.head\n        self.head.next.prev = node\n        self.head.next = node\n\n    def get(self, key):\n        if key not in self.nodes:\n            return -1\n        node = self.nodes[key]\n        self._remove(node)\n        self._add_first(node)\n        return node.value\n\n    def put(self, key, value):\n        if key in self.nodes:\n            self._remove(self.nodes[key])\n        node = Node(key, value)\n        self.nodes[key] = node\n        self._add_first(node)\n        if len(self.nodes) > self.capacity:\n            old = self.tail.prev\n            self._remove(old)\n            del self.nodes[old.key]"},{"order":36,"category":"二叉树","id":"94","title":"二叉树的中序遍历","slug":"binary-tree-inorder-traversal","difficulty":"EASY","pattern":"显式栈模拟递归","tags":["二叉树","栈","遍历"],"summary":"按左子树、根、右子树顺序返回节点值。","signal":"递归遍历可用栈保存尚未访问根节点的路径。","invariant":"当前指针一路向左入栈；栈顶弹出时，它的左子树已处理完，随后转向右子树。","steps":["当前节点非空时持续压栈并左移","为空时弹栈访问","转到弹出节点的右孩子重复"],"time":"O(n)","space":"O(h)","pitfall":"外层条件应是 current 或 stack，避免右子树尚未处理时提前结束。","formula":"","code":"class Solution:\n    def inorderTraversal(self, root):\n        answer, stack = [], []\n        current = root\n        while current or stack:\n            while current:\n                stack.append(current)\n                current = current.left\n            current = stack.pop()\n            answer.append(current.val)\n            current = current.right\n        return answer"},{"order":37,"category":"二叉树","id":"104","title":"二叉树的最大深度","slug":"maximum-depth-of-binary-tree","difficulty":"EASY","pattern":"递归定义树高","tags":["二叉树","深度优先搜索"],"summary":"返回根节点到最远叶子节点的节点数。","signal":"树的深度天然由左右子树深度递归定义。","invariant":"空树深度为 0；非空树深度等于较深子树深度加 1。","steps":["处理空节点返回 0","递归计算左右子树深度","返回 1+max(left,right)"],"time":"O(n)","space":"O(h)","pitfall":"深度按节点数计算时叶子深度为 1。","formula":"depth(T)=1+\\max(depth(T_l),depth(T_r))","code":"class Solution:\n    def maxDepth(self, root):\n        if not root:\n            return 0\n        return 1 + max(self.maxDepth(root.left), self.maxDepth(root.right))"},{"order":38,"category":"二叉树","id":"226","title":"翻转二叉树","slug":"invert-binary-tree","difficulty":"EASY","pattern":"递归交换左右子树","tags":["二叉树","深度优先搜索"],"summary":"把二叉树每个节点的左右子树互换。","signal":"每个节点做同一局部操作，递归遍历即可。","invariant":"当左右子树都已翻转后交换，或先交换再递归，最终结果相同。","steps":["空节点直接返回","交换当前节点左右孩子","递归翻转两个孩子并返回根"],"time":"O(n)","space":"O(h)","pitfall":"若先交换，后续递归要针对交换后的 root.left 与 root.right。","formula":"","code":"class Solution:\n    def invertTree(self, root):\n        if not root:\n            return None\n        root.left, root.right = self.invertTree(root.right), self.invertTree(root.left)\n        return root"},{"order":39,"category":"二叉树","id":"101","title":"对称二叉树","slug":"symmetric-tree","difficulty":"EASY","pattern":"镜像节点成对比较","tags":["二叉树","递归"],"summary":"判断二叉树是否关于中心轴镜像对称。","signal":"对称不是比较两个子树同位置，而是比较左外侧与右外侧、左内侧与右内侧。","invariant":"一对镜像节点必须值相等，且 a.left 对应 b.right、a.right 对应 b.left。","steps":["定义 pair(a,b)","都空为真、仅一空或值不同为假","递归检查两组交叉孩子"],"time":"O(n)","space":"O(h)","pitfall":"递归孩子的配对方向不能写成同向比较。","formula":"","code":"class Solution:\n    def isSymmetric(self, root):\n        def mirror(left, right):\n            if not left or not right:\n                return left is right\n            return (left.val == right.val\n                    and mirror(left.left, right.right)\n                    and mirror(left.right, right.left))\n        return mirror(root.left, root.right) if root else True"},{"order":40,"category":"二叉树","id":"543","title":"二叉树的直径","slug":"diameter-of-binary-tree","difficulty":"EASY","pattern":"后序遍历收集最大左右深度和","tags":["二叉树","深度优先搜索"],"summary":"求任意两节点间最长路径的边数，路径不一定经过根。","signal":"每条最长路径都有一个最高拐点，长度等于该点左右子树深度之和。","invariant":"递归函数返回“向下最长节点数”；全局答案在每个节点用 left+right 更新。","steps":["后序计算左右深度","用 left+right 更新直径","向父节点返回 1+max(left,right)"],"time":"O(n)","space":"O(h)","pitfall":"题目要边数，若空树深度定义为 0，则直径直接用 left+right。","formula":"diameter=\\max_v(h(v_l)+h(v_r))","code":"class Solution:\n    def diameterOfBinaryTree(self, root):\n        answer = 0\n        def depth(node):\n            nonlocal answer\n            if not node:\n                return 0\n            left = depth(node.left)\n            right = depth(node.right)\n            answer = max(answer, left + right)\n            return 1 + max(left, right)\n        depth(root)\n        return answer"},{"order":41,"category":"二叉树","id":"102","title":"二叉树的层序遍历","slug":"binary-tree-level-order-traversal","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"队列按层处理","tags":["二叉树","广度优先搜索"],"summary":"按从上到下、每层从左到右返回节点值。","signal":"树的层级顺序对应广度优先搜索。","invariant":"每轮开始时队列长度就是当前层节点数；只处理这些节点，新孩子留给下一轮。","steps":["根非空时入队","记录本层 size 并弹出恰好 size 个节点","收集值并把孩子入队"],"time":"O(n)","space":"O(w)","pitfall":"不要在 for 循环里用动态变化后的队列长度作为本层边界。","formula":"","code":"from collections import deque\n\nclass Solution:\n    def levelOrder(self, root):\n        if not root:\n            return []\n        queue = deque([root])\n        answer = []\n        while queue:\n            level = []\n            for _ in range(len(queue)):\n                node = queue.popleft()\n                level.append(node.val)\n                if node.left:\n                    queue.append(node.left)\n                if node.right:\n                    queue.append(node.right)\n            answer.append(level)\n        return answer"},{"order":42,"category":"二叉树","id":"108","title":"将有序数组转换为二叉搜索树","slug":"convert-sorted-array-to-binary-search-tree","difficulty":"EASY","pattern":"中点递归分治","tags":["二叉搜索树","分治"],"summary":"把递增数组转换为高度平衡的二叉搜索树。","signal":"有序数组中点天然能把左右元素均匀分为较小与较大两部分。","invariant":"区间中点为根，左半区构成左子树，右半区构成右子树。","steps":["递归函数接收闭区间边界","边界交错返回空","取中点建根并递归构建左右区间"],"time":"O(n)","space":"O(log n)","pitfall":"左右区间必须排除 mid，否则会无限递归。","formula":"","code":"class Solution:\n    def sortedArrayToBST(self, nums):\n        def build(left, right):\n            if left > right:\n                return None\n            mid = (left + right) // 2\n            root = TreeNode(nums[mid])\n            root.left = build(left, mid - 1)\n            root.right = build(mid + 1, right)\n            return root\n        return build(0, len(nums) - 1)"},{"order":43,"category":"二叉树","id":"98","title":"验证二叉搜索树","slug":"validate-binary-search-tree","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"递归传递取值上下界","tags":["二叉搜索树","深度优先搜索"],"summary":"判断一棵树是否满足严格二叉搜索树性质。","signal":"只比较父子不够；左子树所有节点都要小于根，右子树所有节点都要大于根。","invariant":"递归到节点时，它的值必须位于祖先共同限定的开区间 (low,high)。","steps":["根从负无穷到正无穷开始","左递归把上界收紧为当前值","右递归把下界收紧为当前值"],"time":"O(n)","space":"O(h)","pitfall":"BST 通常不允许等值；上下界应使用严格不等号。","formula":"low<node.val<high","code":"class Solution:\n    def isValidBST(self, root):\n        def valid(node, low, high):\n            if not node:\n                return True\n            if not low < node.val < high:\n                return False\n            return valid(node.left, low, node.val) and valid(node.right, node.val, high)\n        return valid(root, float(\"-inf\"), float(\"inf\"))"},{"order":44,"category":"二叉树","id":"230","title":"二叉搜索树中第 K 小的元素","slug":"kth-smallest-element-in-a-bst","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"中序遍历提前停止","tags":["二叉搜索树","栈"],"summary":"返回 BST 中第 k 小的节点值。","signal":"BST 中序遍历结果严格递增，第 k 个访问节点就是答案。","invariant":"栈模拟中序时，每次弹栈得到当前尚未访问的最小节点。","steps":["一路向左压栈","弹出节点并令 k 减一","k 为 0 时返回，否则转向右子树"],"time":"O(h+k)","space":"O(h)","pitfall":"k 从 1 开始计数；仅在弹栈访问节点时递减。","formula":"","code":"class Solution:\n    def kthSmallest(self, root, k):\n        stack = []\n        current = root\n        while True:\n            while current:\n                stack.append(current)\n                current = current.left\n            current = stack.pop()\n            k -= 1\n            if k == 0:\n                return current.val\n            current = current.right"},{"order":45,"category":"二叉树","id":"199","title":"二叉树的右视图","slug":"binary-tree-right-side-view","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"层序取每层最后一个","tags":["二叉树","广度优先搜索"],"summary":"返回从树右侧能看到的各层节点。","signal":"右视图等于每层最右节点，可直接在层序遍历中提取。","invariant":"每层固定处理 size 个节点，第 size 个弹出的节点就是该层最右节点。","steps":["用队列逐层遍历","本层枚举时记录最后一个节点值","处理完一层后加入答案"],"time":"O(n)","space":"O(w)","pitfall":"如果改为 DFS，必须先右后左且只记录第一次到达该深度的节点。","formula":"","code":"from collections import deque\n\nclass Solution:\n    def rightSideView(self, root):\n        if not root:\n            return []\n        queue = deque([root])\n        answer = []\n        while queue:\n            for i in range(len(queue)):\n                node = queue.popleft()\n                if node.left:\n                    queue.append(node.left)\n                if node.right:\n                    queue.append(node.right)\n            answer.append(node.val)\n        return answer"},{"order":46,"category":"二叉树","id":"114","title":"二叉树展开为链表","slug":"flatten-binary-tree-to-linked-list","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"反向前序维护前驱","tags":["二叉树","深度优先搜索"],"summary":"原地把二叉树展开为按前序遍历顺序的右指针链表。","signal":"前序是根-左-右；反向处理右-左-根时可始终知道当前节点的后继。","invariant":"prev 保存已经展开好的后缀头；处理当前节点时令 right=prev、left=None。","steps":["递归先处理右子树","再处理左子树","当前节点右指向 prev、左置空并更新 prev"],"time":"O(n)","space":"O(h)","pitfall":"递归顺序必须是右后左；若先左会破坏前序展开顺序。","formula":"","code":"class Solution:\n    def flatten(self, root):\n        previous = None\n        def visit(node):\n            nonlocal previous\n            if not node:\n                return\n            visit(node.right)\n            visit(node.left)\n            node.right = previous\n            node.left = None\n            previous = node\n        visit(root)"},{"order":47,"category":"二叉树","id":"105","title":"从前序与中序遍历序列构造二叉树","slug":"construct-binary-tree-from-preorder-and-inorder-traversal","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"前序定根，中序分区","tags":["二叉树","分治","哈希表"],"summary":"由无重复值的前序与中序遍历重建二叉树。","signal":"前序首元素是根；根在中序中的位置决定左右子树规模。","invariant":"全局前序指针每次取当前子树根，中序边界限定该子树允许的节点集合。","steps":["建立中序值到下标的映射","递归用前序指针取根","按中序位置先构造左区间再构造右区间"],"time":"O(n)","space":"O(n)","pitfall":"必须先构建左子树再右子树，才能与前序消费顺序一致。","formula":"","code":"class Solution:\n    def buildTree(self, preorder, inorder):\n        positions = {value: i for i, value in enumerate(inorder)}\n        pre_index = 0\n        def build(left, right):\n            nonlocal pre_index\n            if left > right:\n                return None\n            value = preorder[pre_index]\n            pre_index += 1\n            root = TreeNode(value)\n            mid = positions[value]\n            root.left = build(left, mid - 1)\n            root.right = build(mid + 1, right)\n            return root\n        return build(0, len(inorder) - 1)"},{"order":48,"category":"二叉树","id":"437","title":"路径总和 III","slug":"path-sum-iii","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"树上前缀和回溯","tags":["二叉树","前缀和","深度优先搜索"],"summary":"统计树中向下路径和等于 target 的路径数量，路径可从任意节点开始。","signal":"与数组子数组和相同，只是前缀和沿当前根到节点路径维护。","invariant":"访问节点时，当前和 cur 对应此前前缀和 cur-target 的出现次数；离开节点必须撤销当前和。","steps":["哈希表初始化 0:1","DFS 中累加并查询 cur-target","加入当前前缀后递归孩子，返回前删除它"],"time":"O(n)","space":"O(h)","pitfall":"回溯删除不可省略，否则兄弟分支会互相污染。","formula":"pathSum=P_{now}-P_{ancestor}","code":"from collections import defaultdict\n\nclass Solution:\n    def pathSum(self, root, targetSum):\n        count = defaultdict(int)\n        count[0] = 1\n        def visit(node, prefix):\n            if not node:\n                return 0\n            prefix += node.val\n            answer = count[prefix - targetSum]\n            count[prefix] += 1\n            answer += visit(node.left, prefix) + visit(node.right, prefix)\n            count[prefix] -= 1\n            return answer\n        return visit(root, 0)"},{"order":49,"category":"二叉树","id":"236","title":"二叉树的最近公共祖先","slug":"lowest-common-ancestor-of-a-binary-tree","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"后序汇总目标节点","tags":["二叉树","深度优先搜索"],"summary":"返回二叉树中两个指定节点的最近公共祖先。","signal":"若左右子树分别找到一个目标，当前节点就是分叉点。","invariant":"递归返回当前子树找到的 p、q 或它们的 LCA；两侧都非空时当前节点是答案。","steps":["遇空或 p、q 本身直接返回","递归搜索左右子树","两侧都命中返回当前节点，否则返回非空一侧"],"time":"O(n)","space":"O(h)","pitfall":"这里依赖 p、q 确实存在；比较节点身份而非仅比较值。","formula":"","code":"class Solution:\n    def lowestCommonAncestor(self, root, p, q):\n        if not root or root is p or root is q:\n            return root\n        left = self.lowestCommonAncestor(root.left, p, q)\n        right = self.lowestCommonAncestor(root.right, p, q)\n        if left and right:\n            return root\n        return left or right"},{"order":50,"category":"二叉树","id":"124","title":"二叉树中的最大路径和","slug":"binary-tree-maximum-path-sum","difficulty":"HARD","pattern":"后序计算单边贡献","tags":["二叉树","动态规划"],"summary":"求树中任意非空路径的最大节点值之和，路径不可重复经过节点。","signal":"对父节点只能贡献一条向下分支，但在当前节点更新答案时可同时连接左右分支。","invariant":"负贡献应丢弃；gain(node)=node.val+max(0,left,right)，而穿过节点的候选为 node.val+max(0,left)+max(0,right)。","steps":["后序得到左右单边贡献并截断负值","用左右贡献加当前值更新全局答案","返回当前值加较大一侧贡献"],"time":"O(n)","space":"O(h)","pitfall":"全局答案应初始化为负无穷，避免全负树错误。","formula":"gain(v)=v+\\max(0,g_l,g_r)","code":"class Solution:\n    def maxPathSum(self, root):\n        answer = float(\"-inf\")\n        def gain(node):\n            nonlocal answer\n            if not node:\n                return 0\n            left = max(0, gain(node.left))\n            right = max(0, gain(node.right))\n            answer = max(answer, node.val + left + right)\n            return node.val + max(left, right)\n        gain(root)\n        return answer"},{"order":51,"category":"图论","id":"200","title":"岛屿数量","slug":"number-of-islands","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"网格洪水填充","tags":["矩阵","深度优先搜索"],"summary":"统计由上下左右相邻陆地组成的岛屿数量。","signal":"每发现一个尚未访问的陆地，就找到了一个新连通分量。","invariant":"一次 DFS/BFS 会把当前岛屿的全部陆地标记，之后不会重复计数。","steps":["扫描所有格子","遇到 1 时答案加一并启动搜索","把连通陆地改为 0 或加入访问集"],"time":"O(mn)","space":"O(mn) 最坏递归栈","pitfall":"原地改图最省空间，但会破坏输入；递归深度过大时可改显式栈。","formula":"","code":"class Solution:\n    def numIslands(self, grid):\n        rows, cols = len(grid), len(grid[0])\n        def flood(row, col):\n            if not (0 <= row < rows and 0 <= col < cols) or grid[row][col] != \"1\":\n                return\n            grid[row][col] = \"0\"\n            flood(row + 1, col)\n            flood(row - 1, col)\n            flood(row, col + 1)\n            flood(row, col - 1)\n        answer = 0\n        for row in range(rows):\n            for col in range(cols):\n                if grid[row][col] == \"1\":\n                    answer += 1\n                    flood(row, col)\n        return answer"},{"order":52,"category":"图论","id":"994","title":"腐烂的橘子","slug":"rotting-oranges","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"多源 BFS 分层扩散","tags":["矩阵","广度优先搜索"],"summary":"每分钟腐烂向四邻扩散，求全部新鲜橘子腐烂所需最少时间。","signal":"多个起点同时、等速扩散，使用多源 BFS。","invariant":"队列中同一层都是同一分钟新腐烂的橘子；新鲜计数归零时当前分钟数即答案。","steps":["把所有腐烂橘子入队并统计新鲜数","按层扩散，只在感染新鲜橘子时入队","每完成一层分钟加一，最后检查剩余新鲜数"],"time":"O(mn)","space":"O(mn)","pitfall":"分钟只在本层确实扩散出新节点时增加，可用把 time 初始化为 0 的分层写法规避空层。","formula":"","code":"from collections import deque\n\nclass Solution:\n    def orangesRotting(self, grid):\n        rows, cols = len(grid), len(grid[0])\n        queue = deque()\n        fresh = 0\n        for row in range(rows):\n            for col in range(cols):\n                if grid[row][col] == 2:\n                    queue.append((row, col))\n                elif grid[row][col] == 1:\n                    fresh += 1\n        minutes = 0\n        while queue and fresh:\n            for _ in range(len(queue)):\n                row, col = queue.popleft()\n                for dr, dc in ((1, 0), (-1, 0), (0, 1), (0, -1)):\n                    nr, nc = row + dr, col + dc\n                    if 0 <= nr < rows and 0 <= nc < cols and grid[nr][nc] == 1:\n                        grid[nr][nc] = 2\n                        fresh -= 1\n                        queue.append((nr, nc))\n            minutes += 1\n        return minutes if fresh == 0 else -1"},{"order":53,"category":"图论","id":"207","title":"课程表","slug":"course-schedule","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"拓扑排序检测环","tags":["图","拓扑排序"],"summary":"判断有向先修关系中能否完成所有课程。","signal":"课程依赖能否排出顺序，等价于有向图是否无环。","invariant":"Kahn 算法中入度为 0 的节点当前没有未完成先修；若最终处理数小于课程数则存在环。","steps":["建立先修到后续的邻接表并统计入度","把所有入度 0 课程入队","逐个删除其出边并把新入度 0 节点入队"],"time":"O(V+E)","space":"O(V+E)","pitfall":"边方向应是 prerequisite→course；重复边若存在也要一致地计入与删除。","formula":"","code":"from collections import deque\n\nclass Solution:\n    def canFinish(self, numCourses, prerequisites):\n        graph = [[] for _ in range(numCourses)]\n        indegree = [0] * numCourses\n        for course, prerequisite in prerequisites:\n            graph[prerequisite].append(course)\n            indegree[course] += 1\n        queue = deque(i for i, degree in enumerate(indegree) if degree == 0)\n        completed = 0\n        while queue:\n            node = queue.popleft()\n            completed += 1\n            for neighbor in graph[node]:\n                indegree[neighbor] -= 1\n                if indegree[neighbor] == 0:\n                    queue.append(neighbor)\n        return completed == numCourses"},{"order":54,"category":"图论","id":"208","title":"实现 Trie (前缀树)","slug":"implement-trie-prefix-tree","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"字符多叉树","tags":["字典树","设计"],"summary":"实现单词插入、完整单词查询与前缀查询。","signal":"大量字符串共享前缀，Trie 可把公共前缀只存一次。","invariant":"从根到节点的路径拼出前缀；终止标记区分“一个完整单词”与“仅是其他词的前缀”。","steps":["每个节点保存 children 与 is_end","插入时沿字符创建缺失孩子","查询时走完整路径，search 额外检查 is_end"],"time":"O(L) 每次","space":"O(字符总数)","pitfall":"startsWith 不要求终止标记；空前缀通常可视为存在。","formula":"","code":"class TrieNode:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.children = {}\n        self.is_end = False\n\nclass Trie:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.root = TrieNode()\n\n    def insert(self, word):\n        node = self.root\n        for ch in word:\n            node = node.children.setdefault(ch, TrieNode())\n        node.is_end = True\n\n    def _find(self, text):\n        node = self.root\n        for ch in text:\n            if ch not in node.children:\n                return None\n            node = node.children[ch]\n        return node\n\n    def search(self, word):\n        node = self._find(word)\n        return bool(node and node.is_end)\n\n    def startsWith(self, prefix):\n        return self._find(prefix) is not None"},{"order":55,"category":"回溯","id":"46","title":"全排列","slug":"permutations","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"选择列表回溯","tags":["回溯","数组"],"summary":"返回不含重复数字数组的所有排列。","signal":"答案是有顺序的 n 次选择，每个元素恰用一次。","invariant":"path 保存当前排列，used 保证同一条路径不重复使用元素；长度为 n 时得到一个答案。","steps":["遍历所有候选","选择未使用元素并标记","递归后撤销 path 与 used 状态"],"time":"O(n·n!)","space":"O(n)","pitfall":"加入答案时要复制 path，不能保存同一个可变列表引用。","formula":"n!","code":"class Solution:\n    def permute(self, nums):\n        answer, path = [], []\n        used = [False] * len(nums)\n        def backtrack():\n            if len(path) == len(nums):\n                answer.append(path.copy())\n                return\n            for i, x in enumerate(nums):\n                if used[i]:\n                    continue\n                used[i] = True\n                path.append(x)\n                backtrack()\n                path.pop()\n                used[i] = False\n        backtrack()\n        return answer"},{"order":56,"category":"回溯","id":"78","title":"子集","slug":"subsets","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"每层从 start 向后选择","tags":["回溯","数组"],"summary":"返回无重复数组的所有子集。","signal":"每个元素都有选或不选两种状态，也可按组合方式枚举。","invariant":"path 在每次进入递归时就是一个合法子集；start 保证元素只向后选择。","steps":["先把当前 path 副本加入答案","从 start 枚举下一元素并选择","递归 i+1 后撤销选择"],"time":"O(n·2^n)","space":"O(n)","pitfall":"空集也必须加入；组合写法不要等到固定长度才收集。","formula":"2^n","code":"class Solution:\n    def subsets(self, nums):\n        answer, path = [], []\n        def backtrack(start):\n            answer.append(path.copy())\n            for i in range(start, len(nums)):\n                path.append(nums[i])\n                backtrack(i + 1)\n                path.pop()\n        backtrack(0)\n        return answer"},{"order":57,"category":"回溯","id":"17","title":"电话号码的字母组合","slug":"letter-combinations-of-a-phone-number","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"按位构造笛卡尔积","tags":["回溯","字符串"],"summary":"根据电话按键映射，返回数字串可能对应的所有字母组合。","signal":"每一位数字提供一组独立候选，逐位回溯即可。","invariant":"递归深度等于已经处理的数字位数，path 长度等于该深度。","steps":["空输入直接返回空列表","在当前位置遍历该数字对应字母","加入字母递归下一位后撤销"],"time":"O(4^n·n)","space":"O(n)","pitfall":"题目通常要求空输入返回 [] 而不是 [\"\"]。","formula":"","code":"class Solution:\n    def letterCombinations(self, digits):\n        if not digits:\n            return []\n        letters = {\n            \"2\": \"abc\", \"3\": \"def\", \"4\": \"ghi\", \"5\": \"jkl\",\n            \"6\": \"mno\", \"7\": \"pqrs\", \"8\": \"tuv\", \"9\": \"wxyz\"\n        }\n        answer, path = [], []\n        def backtrack(index):\n            if index == len(digits):\n                answer.append(\"\".join(path))\n                return\n            for ch in letters[digits[index]]:\n                path.append(ch)\n                backtrack(index + 1)\n                path.pop()\n        backtrack(0)\n        return answer"},{"order":58,"category":"回溯","id":"39","title":"组合总和","slug":"combination-sum","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"可重复选择的组合回溯","tags":["回溯","剪枝"],"summary":"从无重复正整数中选若干数，使和为 target；同一数字可重复使用。","signal":"组合不计顺序，可排序后通过 start 限制选择顺序。","invariant":"递归只从当前 start 向后选；允许复用时下一层仍传 i。","steps":["排序候选","枚举从 start 开始且不超过剩余值的数字","选择后递归 remain-x 且 start=i，剩余为 0 时收集"],"time":"指数级","space":"O(target/min(c))","pitfall":"复用当前数时传 i，不是 i+1；排序后可在 x>remain 时直接 break。","formula":"","code":"class Solution:\n    def combinationSum(self, candidates, target):\n        candidates.sort()\n        answer, path = [], []\n        def backtrack(start, remain):\n            if remain == 0:\n                answer.append(path.copy())\n                return\n            for i in range(start, len(candidates)):\n                value = candidates[i]\n                if value > remain:\n                    break\n                path.append(value)\n                backtrack(i, remain - value)\n                path.pop()\n        backtrack(0, target)\n        return answer"},{"order":59,"category":"回溯","id":"22","title":"括号生成","slug":"generate-parentheses","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"合法前缀剪枝","tags":["回溯","字符串"],"summary":"生成 n 对括号的全部合法组合。","signal":"不必生成全部 2^(2n) 串再验证，可以只扩展合法前缀。","invariant":"任意前缀中右括号数不能超过左括号数，且两者都不超过 n。","steps":["记录已用 left 与 right","left<n 时可加左括号","right<left 时可加右括号，长度 2n 时收集"],"time":"O(C_n·n)","space":"O(n)","pitfall":"加右括号条件是 right<left，而不是 right<n。","formula":"C_n=\\frac{1}{n+1}{2n\\choose n}","code":"class Solution:\n    def generateParenthesis(self, n):\n        answer, path = [], []\n        def backtrack(left, right):\n            if len(path) == 2 * n:\n                answer.append(\"\".join(path))\n                return\n            if left < n:\n                path.append(\"(\")\n                backtrack(left + 1, right)\n                path.pop()\n            if right < left:\n                path.append(\")\")\n                backtrack(left, right + 1)\n                path.pop()\n        backtrack(0, 0)\n        return answer"},{"order":60,"category":"回溯","id":"79","title":"单词搜索","slug":"word-search","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"网格路径回溯","tags":["矩阵","回溯"],"summary":"判断单词能否由网格中相邻单元格依次组成，单元格不可重复使用。","signal":"路径选择会影响后续，失败后需恢复现场。","invariant":"DFS 的当前位置必须匹配 word[k]，并在当前递归路径上临时标记已访问。","steps":["从每个格子尝试作为起点","匹配后临时改成哨兵并搜索四邻","成功直接返回，失败恢复原字符"],"time":"O(mn·4^L)","space":"O(L)","pitfall":"恢复字符必须放在所有失败路径之后；用就地哨兵时确保哨兵不可能出现在输入。","formula":"","code":"class Solution:\n    def exist(self, board, word):\n        rows, cols = len(board), len(board[0])\n        def search(row, col, index):\n            if index == len(word):\n                return True\n            if not (0 <= row < rows and 0 <= col < cols) or board[row][col] != word[index]:\n                return False\n            saved = board[row][col]\n            board[row][col] = \"#\"\n            found = (search(row + 1, col, index + 1) or\n                     search(row - 1, col, index + 1) or\n                     search(row, col + 1, index + 1) or\n                     search(row, col - 1, index + 1))\n            board[row][col] = saved\n            return found\n        return any(search(r, c, 0) for r in range(rows) for c in range(cols))"},{"order":61,"category":"回溯","id":"131","title":"分割回文串","slug":"palindrome-partitioning","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"枚举切点加回文判断","tags":["回溯","字符串"],"summary":"把字符串分割成若干回文子串，返回全部方案。","signal":"每层选择下一段结束位置，只有当前段是回文才继续。","invariant":"start 左侧已经形成合法回文分割；start 到 end 的候选通过回文检测后加入 path。","steps":["从 start 枚举 end","若 s[start:end+1] 为回文则选择它","递归 end+1，start 到末尾时收集"],"time":"O(n·2^n)","space":"O(n)","pitfall":"切片终点是 end+1；高阶优化可预处理回文 DP 降低重复判断。","formula":"","code":"class Solution:\n    def partition(self, s):\n        answer, path = [], []\n        def is_palindrome(left, right):\n            while left < right:\n                if s[left] != s[right]:\n                    return False\n                left += 1\n                right -= 1\n            return True\n        def backtrack(start):\n            if start == len(s):\n                answer.append(path.copy())\n                return\n            for end in range(start, len(s)):\n                if is_palindrome(start, end):\n                    path.append(s[start:end + 1])\n                    backtrack(end + 1)\n                    path.pop()\n        backtrack(0)\n        return answer"},{"order":62,"category":"回溯","id":"51","title":"N 皇后","slug":"n-queens","difficulty":"HARD","pattern":"按行放置并维护攻击集合","tags":["回溯","集合"],"summary":"在 n×n 棋盘放 n 个皇后，使任意两个不同行列且不在同一对角线。","signal":"每行恰放一个皇后，列与两类对角线可用集合 O(1) 判冲突。","invariant":"同一主对角线 r-c 相等，同一次对角线 r+c 相等。","steps":["递归处理第 r 行","枚举不在 cols、diag1、diag2 的列","放置后递归下一行，返回时撤销"],"time":"O(n!)","space":"O(n)","pitfall":"两种对角线键不要混淆；输出棋盘时再把列位置转换成字符串。","formula":"","code":"class Solution:\n    def solveNQueens(self, n):\n        answer = []\n        queens = [-1] * n\n        columns, diagonal1, diagonal2 = set(), set(), set()\n        def backtrack(row):\n            if row == n:\n                answer.append([\".\" * col + \"Q\" + \".\" * (n - col - 1) for col in queens])\n                return\n            for col in range(n):\n                if col in columns or row - col in diagonal1 or row + col in diagonal2:\n                    continue\n                queens[row] = col\n                columns.add(col); diagonal1.add(row - col); diagonal2.add(row + col)\n                backtrack(row + 1)\n                columns.remove(col); diagonal1.remove(row - col); diagonal2.remove(row + col)\n        backtrack(0)\n        return answer"},{"order":63,"category":"二分查找","id":"35","title":"搜索插入位置","slug":"search-insert-position","difficulty":"EASY","pattern":"左边界二分","tags":["数组","二分查找"],"summary":"在有序数组中返回目标下标；不存在时返回应插入的位置。","signal":"寻找第一个大于等于 target 的位置，即 lower_bound。","invariant":"搜索区间 [left,right) 中，left 左侧都小于 target，right 及其右侧候选都大于等于 target。","steps":["初始化 left=0、right=n","mid 值小于目标则 left=mid+1","否则 right=mid，区间收敛后返回 left"],"time":"O(log n)","space":"O(1)","pitfall":"半开区间循环条件是 left<right，right 初值为 n。","formula":"","code":"class Solution:\n    def searchInsert(self, nums, target):\n        left, right = 0, len(nums)\n        while left < right:\n            mid = (left + right) // 2\n            if nums[mid] < target:\n                left = mid + 1\n            else:\n                right = mid\n        return left"},{"order":64,"category":"二分查找","id":"74","title":"搜索二维矩阵","slug":"search-a-2d-matrix","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"把矩阵视为一维有序数组","tags":["矩阵","二分查找"],"summary":"每行递增且下一行首值大于上一行尾值，在矩阵中查找目标。","signal":"整张矩阵按行展开后是一个全局有序数组。","invariant":"虚拟一维下标 idx 对应 matrix[idx//n][idx%n]。","steps":["在 [0,mn) 上做标准二分","把 mid 映射成行列读取值","按比较结果收缩区间"],"time":"O(log(mn))","space":"O(1)","pitfall":"列数 n 不能为 0；下标映射的除数是列数。","formula":"row=idx\\div n,\\ col=idx\\bmod n","code":"class Solution:\n    def searchMatrix(self, matrix, target):\n        rows, cols = len(matrix), len(matrix[0])\n        left, right = 0, rows * cols\n        while left < right:\n            mid = (left + right) // 2\n            value = matrix[mid // cols][mid % cols]\n            if value < target:\n                left = mid + 1\n            else:\n                right = mid\n        return left < rows * cols and matrix[left // cols][left % cols] == target"},{"order":65,"category":"二分查找","id":"34","title":"在排序数组中查找元素的第一个和最后一个位置","slug":"find-first-and-last-position-of-element-in-sorted-array","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"两次边界二分","tags":["数组","二分查找"],"summary":"在有序数组中返回目标值的首尾下标，不存在返回 [-1,-1]。","signal":"重复元素区间可由第一个 ≥target 与第一个 >target 的位置确定。","invariant":"lower_bound(x) 返回第一个不小于 x 的下标；右端点为 lower_bound(target+1)-1 或 upper_bound(target)-1。","steps":["写通用 lower_bound","得到 left=lower_bound(target)","若越界或值不同则不存在，否则 right=lower_bound(target+1)-1"],"time":"O(log n)","space":"O(1)","pitfall":"先验证 left 是否真实命中；用 target+1 仅适用于整数，本实现也可写 upper_bound。","formula":"","code":"class Solution:\n    def searchRange(self, nums, target):\n        def lower_bound(value):\n            left, right = 0, len(nums)\n            while left < right:\n                mid = (left + right) // 2\n                if nums[mid] < value:\n                    left = mid + 1\n                else:\n                    right = mid\n            return left\n        left = lower_bound(target)\n        if left == len(nums) or nums[left] != target:\n            return [-1, -1]\n        return [left, lower_bound(target + 1) - 1]"},{"order":66,"category":"二分查找","id":"33","title":"搜索旋转排序数组","slug":"search-in-rotated-sorted-array","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"判断有序半区","tags":["数组","二分查找"],"summary":"在无重复的旋转升序数组中查找目标下标。","signal":"任意二分位置至少有一侧仍然有序，可判断目标是否落在该侧。","invariant":"每轮确认 [left,mid] 或 [mid,right] 哪段有序，再用端点范围排除另一半。","steps":["比较 nums[left] 与 nums[mid] 判断左段是否有序","若目标位于有序段范围就保留该段","否则搜索另一段"],"time":"O(log n)","space":"O(1)","pitfall":"范围判断的等号要与边界更新配套；数组无重复使有序侧判断明确。","formula":"","code":"class Solution:\n    def search(self, nums, target):\n        left, right = 0, len(nums) - 1\n        while left <= right:\n            mid = (left + right) // 2\n            if nums[mid] == target:\n                return mid\n            if nums[left] <= nums[mid]:\n                if nums[left] <= target < nums[mid]:\n                    right = mid - 1\n                else:\n                    left = mid + 1\n            else:\n                if nums[mid] < target <= nums[right]:\n                    left = mid + 1\n                else:\n                    right = mid - 1\n        return -1"},{"order":67,"category":"二分查找","id":"153","title":"寻找旋转排序数组中的最小值","slug":"find-minimum-in-rotated-sorted-array","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"与右端点比较","tags":["数组","二分查找"],"summary":"在无重复的旋转升序数组中找到最小值。","signal":"最小值是旋转断点；mid 与 right 的关系能判断断点所在侧。","invariant":"若 nums[mid]>nums[right]，最小值一定在 mid 右侧；否则最小值在含 mid 的左侧。","steps":["维护闭区间 [left,right]","按 mid 与 right 比较更新 left=mid+1 或 right=mid","相遇位置即最小值"],"time":"O(log n)","space":"O(1)","pitfall":"不能用 nums[left] 作统一比较基准；right=mid 必须保留 mid。","formula":"","code":"class Solution:\n    def findMin(self, nums):\n        left, right = 0, len(nums) - 1\n        while left < right:\n            mid = (left + right) // 2\n            if nums[mid] > nums[right]:\n                left = mid + 1\n            else:\n                right = mid\n        return nums[left]"},{"order":68,"category":"二分查找","id":"4","title":"寻找两个正序数组的中位数","slug":"median-of-two-sorted-arrays","difficulty":"HARD","pattern":"二分较短数组的分割线","tags":["数组","二分查找","分治"],"summary":"求两个有序数组合并后的中位数，要求对数复杂度。","signal":"不真正合并，而是在两数组中选分割位置，使左半元素数正确且左侧最大值不超过右侧最小值。","invariant":"i+j=(m+n+1)//2；合法分割满足 A[i-1]≤B[j] 且 B[j-1]≤A[i]。","steps":["确保 A 是短数组并二分 i","由总左半长度计算 j","根据交叉边界移动 i，合法后由四个边界值计算中位数"],"time":"O(log min(m,n))","space":"O(1)","pitfall":"数组边界要用 ±∞ 哨兵；总长度奇偶决定是否需要右半最小值。","formula":"i+j=\\lfloor\\frac{m+n+1}{2}\\rfloor","code":"class Solution:\n    def findMedianSortedArrays(self, nums1, nums2):\n        if len(nums1) > len(nums2):\n            nums1, nums2 = nums2, nums1\n        m, n = len(nums1), len(nums2)\n        left_size = (m + n + 1) // 2\n        low, high = 0, m\n        while low <= high:\n            i = (low + high) // 2\n            j = left_size - i\n            a_left = nums1[i - 1] if i else float(\"-inf\")\n            a_right = nums1[i] if i < m else float(\"inf\")\n            b_left = nums2[j - 1] if j else float(\"-inf\")\n            b_right = nums2[j] if j < n else float(\"inf\")\n            if a_left <= b_right and b_left <= a_right:\n                if (m + n) % 2:\n                    return max(a_left, b_left)\n                return (max(a_left, b_left) + min(a_right, b_right)) / 2\n            if a_left > b_right:\n                high = i - 1\n            else:\n                low = i + 1"},{"order":69,"category":"栈","id":"20","title":"有效的括号","slug":"valid-parentheses","difficulty":"EASY","pattern":"栈匹配最近未闭合左括号","tags":["栈","字符串"],"summary":"判断括号字符串的类型与嵌套顺序是否有效。","signal":"右括号必须与最近出现且尚未匹配的左括号配对，符合后进先出。","invariant":"栈保存期望遇到的右括号；遇右括号时它必须等于栈顶。","steps":["遇左括号就压入对应右括号","遇右括号时检查栈非空且弹出值相同","最后栈必须为空"],"time":"O(n)","space":"O(n)","pitfall":"不能只比较三种括号数量；顺序和嵌套同样重要。","formula":"","code":"class Solution:\n    def isValid(self, s):\n        expected = {\"(\": \")\", \"[\": \"]\", \"{\": \"}\"}\n        stack = []\n        for ch in s:\n            if ch in expected:\n                stack.append(expected[ch])\n            elif not stack or stack.pop() != ch:\n                return False\n        return not stack"},{"order":70,"category":"栈","id":"155","title":"最小栈","slug":"min-stack","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"同步维护最小值栈","tags":["栈","设计"],"summary":"设计支持 push、pop、top 和 O(1) getMin 的栈。","signal":"普通栈无法常数时间知道历史最小值，可让每层同时记录此前最小值。","invariant":"辅助栈顶永远是与主栈当前状态对应的最小值。","steps":["push 时主栈压值、最小栈压 min(x,旧最小)","pop 时两栈同步弹出","top 与 getMin 分别读对应栈顶"],"time":"O(1) 每次操作","space":"O(n)","pitfall":"新值等于当前最小时也要压入辅助栈，才能与主栈长度同步。","formula":"","code":"class MinStack:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.values = []\n        self.minimums = []\n\n    def push(self, val):\n        self.values.append(val)\n        self.minimums.append(val if not self.minimums else min(val, self.minimums[-1]))\n\n    def pop(self):\n        self.minimums.pop()\n        return self.values.pop()\n\n    def top(self):\n        return self.values[-1]\n\n    def getMin(self):\n        return self.minimums[-1]"},{"order":71,"category":"栈","id":"394","title":"字符串解码","slug":"decode-string","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"栈保存外层状态","tags":["栈","字符串"],"summary":"解码形如 k[encoded] 的嵌套字符串。","signal":"遇到内层方括号时需要暂存外层已构造字符串和重复次数。","invariant":"栈帧保存进入 [ 之前的 prefix 与 repeat；遇 ] 时当前串完整，可回填到外层。","steps":["连续数字累积 repeat","遇 [ 时压入 prefix 与 repeat 并重置当前串","遇 ] 时弹栈并拼接，普通字符直接追加"],"time":"O(output)","space":"O(嵌套深度+输出)","pitfall":"重复次数可能多位，需 num=num*10+digit；复杂度至少与最终输出长度成正比。","formula":"","code":"class Solution:\n    def decodeString(self, s):\n        stack = []\n        current = []\n        repeat = 0\n        for ch in s:\n            if ch.isdigit():\n                repeat = repeat * 10 + int(ch)\n            elif ch == \"[\":\n                stack.append((current, repeat))\n                current, repeat = [], 0\n            elif ch == \"]\":\n                prefix, times = stack.pop()\n                current = prefix + current * times\n            else:\n                current.append(ch)\n        return \"\".join(current)"},{"order":72,"category":"栈","id":"739","title":"每日温度","slug":"daily-temperatures","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"单调递减下标栈","tags":["数组","单调栈"],"summary":"对每天温度，返回要等几天才会遇到更高温度。","signal":"每个位置在等待“右侧第一个更大元素”，使用单调栈。","invariant":"栈中下标对应温度单调不增；当前温度更高时，它就是栈顶尚未解决位置的第一个更高温。","steps":["遍历温度下标","当前值大于栈顶温度时不断弹栈并记录距离","把当前下标压栈等待未来解决"],"time":"O(n)","space":"O(n)","pitfall":"必须用严格大于；相同温度不能解决等待。","formula":"","code":"class Solution:\n    def dailyTemperatures(self, temperatures):\n        answer = [0] * len(temperatures)\n        stack = []\n        for i, value in enumerate(temperatures):\n            while stack and temperatures[stack[-1]] < value:\n                previous = stack.pop()\n                answer[previous] = i - previous\n            stack.append(i)\n        return answer"},{"order":73,"category":"栈","id":"84","title":"柱状图中最大的矩形","slug":"largest-rectangle-in-histogram","difficulty":"HARD","pattern":"单调递增栈结算高度","tags":["数组","单调栈"],"summary":"给定柱高，求能覆盖连续柱子的最大矩形面积。","signal":"某柱作为最矮高度的最大宽度由左右第一个更矮柱限定。","invariant":"栈保持柱高递增；遇更矮柱时，被弹柱的右边界确定，弹栈后的新栈顶是其左边界。","steps":["在首尾加高度 0 的哨兵","遍历时遇更矮高度不断弹栈","用 width=i-stack[-1]-1 计算被弹高度面积"],"time":"O(n)","space":"O(n)","pitfall":"宽度要减 1；尾部 0 哨兵用于结算所有剩余柱子。","formula":"A=h\\,(right-left-1)","code":"class Solution:\n    def largestRectangleArea(self, heights):\n        values = [0] + heights + [0]\n        stack = []\n        answer = 0\n        for i, height in enumerate(values):\n            while stack and values[stack[-1]] > height:\n                h = values[stack.pop()]\n                width = i - stack[-1] - 1\n                answer = max(answer, h * width)\n            stack.append(i)\n        return answer"},{"order":74,"category":"堆","id":"215","title":"数组中的第K个最大元素","slug":"kth-largest-element-in-an-array","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"容量 k 的小根堆","tags":["数组","堆"],"summary":"返回未排序数组第 k 大元素，重复元素按排序位置计数。","signal":"只需保留当前最大的 k 个元素，它们中最小的就是第 k 大。","invariant":"小根堆大小始终不超过 k；处理完后堆顶为全局第 k 大。","steps":["遍历元素并压入小根堆","堆大小超过 k 时弹出最小值","返回最终堆顶"],"time":"O(n log k)","space":"O(k)","pitfall":"“第 k 大”不是第 k 个不同值，不要先去重。","formula":"","code":"import heapq\n\nclass Solution:\n    def findKthLargest(self, nums, k):\n        heap = []\n        for x in nums:\n            heapq.heappush(heap, x)\n            if len(heap) > k:\n                heapq.heappop(heap)\n        return heap[0]"},{"order":75,"category":"堆","id":"347","title":"前 K 个高频元素","slug":"top-k-frequent-elements","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"频次桶排序","tags":["哈希表","桶排序"],"summary":"返回出现频率最高的 k 个元素，顺序任意。","signal":"频次最大不超过 n，可用“频次作为桶下标”避免比较排序。","invariant":"buckets[f] 保存所有出现 f 次的值；从高频桶向低频取即可。","steps":["Counter 统计每个值频次","创建 n+1 个桶并按频次放入","从后向前收集直到 k 个"],"time":"O(n)","space":"O(n)","pitfall":"收集达到 k 个后要立刻返回；题目保证答案唯一通常不会截断同频选择歧义。","formula":"","code":"from collections import Counter\n\nclass Solution:\n    def topKFrequent(self, nums, k):\n        count = Counter(nums)\n        buckets = [[] for _ in range(len(nums) + 1)]\n        for value, frequency in count.items():\n            buckets[frequency].append(value)\n        answer = []\n        for frequency in range(len(buckets) - 1, 0, -1):\n            for value in buckets[frequency]:\n                answer.append(value)\n                if len(answer) == k:\n                    return answer"},{"order":76,"category":"堆","id":"295","title":"数据流的中位数","slug":"find-median-from-data-stream","difficulty":"HARD","pattern":"大小堆维护两半","tags":["堆","设计"],"summary":"支持不断添加数字，并随时返回当前数据中位数。","signal":"把数据分成较小一半与较大一半，各自只需知道边界值。","invariant":"最大堆 low 保存较小半，最小堆 high 保存较大半；low 大小等于 high 或多 1，且 max(low)≤min(high)。","steps":["新值先入 low 再把其最大值移到 high","若 high 更大则把其最小值移回 low","按总数奇偶返回 low 顶或两堆顶平均"],"time":"O(log n) 添加，O(1) 查询","space":"O(n)","pitfall":"Python 用负数模拟最大堆；平均值要做浮点除法。","formula":"","code":"import heapq\n\nclass MedianFinder:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.low = []   # 最大堆：存负数\n        self.high = []  # 最小堆\n\n    def addNum(self, num):\n        heapq.heappush(self.low, -num)\n        heapq.heappush(self.high, -heapq.heappop(self.low))\n        if len(self.high) > len(self.low):\n            heapq.heappush(self.low, -heapq.heappop(self.high))\n\n    def findMedian(self):\n        if len(self.low) > len(self.high):\n            return -self.low[0]\n        return (-self.low[0] + self.high[0]) / 2"},{"order":77,"category":"贪心算法","id":"121","title":"买卖股票的最佳时机","slug":"best-time-to-buy-and-sell-stock","difficulty":"EASY","pattern":"维护历史最低价","tags":["数组","贪心"],"summary":"最多进行一次先买后卖，求最大利润。","signal":"卖出日固定时，最佳买入价就是它之前的最低价格。","invariant":"遍历到 price 时，min_price 只来自此前日期；当前可得利润为 price-min_price。","steps":["初始化最低价为无穷","每个价格先计算或更新最大利润","再更新历史最低价"],"time":"O(n)","space":"O(1)","pitfall":"不能在卖出后再买入形成逆序；全程下降时答案为 0。","formula":"profit_i=p_i-\\min_{j<i}p_j","code":"class Solution:\n    def maxProfit(self, prices):\n        minimum = float(\"inf\")\n        answer = 0\n        for price in prices:\n            answer = max(answer, price - minimum)\n            minimum = min(minimum, price)\n        return answer"},{"order":78,"category":"贪心算法","id":"55","title":"跳跃游戏","slug":"jump-game","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"维护最远可达位置","tags":["数组","贪心"],"summary":"每个位置给出最大跳跃长度，判断能否到达末尾。","signal":"不需要关心具体路径，只关心目前所有可达位置能覆盖到的最远边界。","invariant":"若 i≤farthest，位置 i 可被访问，并可用 i+nums[i] 扩张最远边界。","steps":["从左到右遍历","若 i 超过最远边界立即失败","更新 farthest=max(farthest,i+nums[i])，覆盖末尾即成功"],"time":"O(n)","space":"O(1)","pitfall":"判断条件是当前下标是否可达，而不是当前位置步长是否为 0。","formula":"","code":"class Solution:\n    def canJump(self, nums):\n        farthest = 0\n        for i, step in enumerate(nums):\n            if i > farthest:\n                return False\n            farthest = max(farthest, i + step)\n            if farthest >= len(nums) - 1:\n                return True\n        return True"},{"order":79,"category":"贪心算法","id":"45","title":"跳跃游戏 II","slug":"jump-game-ii","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"分层扩张最远边界","tags":["数组","贪心"],"summary":"保证可达末尾，求最少跳跃次数。","signal":"把可达区间看作 BFS 的一层：扫描完当前层才增加一步，并用期间最远位置形成下一层。","invariant":"end 是当前跳数能到的边界，farthest 是再跳一步能到的最远位置。","steps":["遍历到倒数第二个位置","持续更新 farthest","到达 end 时 jumps 加一并把 end 更新为 farthest"],"time":"O(n)","space":"O(1)","pitfall":"无需遍历最后一个位置，否则可能多计一次跳跃。","formula":"","code":"class Solution:\n    def jump(self, nums):\n        jumps = end = farthest = 0\n        for i in range(len(nums) - 1):\n            farthest = max(farthest, i + nums[i])\n            if i == end:\n                jumps += 1\n                end = farthest\n        return jumps"},{"order":80,"category":"贪心算法","id":"763","title":"划分字母区间","slug":"partition-labels","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"按字符最后位置切段","tags":["字符串","贪心"],"summary":"把字符串尽量多地分段，使每个字母最多出现在一个片段中。","signal":"某字符一旦进入当前片段，片段至少要延伸到它最后一次出现的位置。","invariant":"end 是当前片段所有已见字符最后位置的最大值；扫描下标到 end 时可以安全切分。","steps":["预处理每个字符最后下标","扫描时用 last[ch] 扩张 end","i==end 时记录片段长度并开始下一段"],"time":"O(n)","space":"O(Σ)","pitfall":"片段终点应取区间内所有字符最后位置的最大值，不能只看起始字符。","formula":"","code":"class Solution:\n    def partitionLabels(self, s):\n        last = {ch: i for i, ch in enumerate(s)}\n        answer = []\n        start = end = 0\n        for i, ch in enumerate(s):\n            end = max(end, last[ch])\n            if i == end:\n                answer.append(end - start + 1)\n                start = i + 1\n        return answer"},{"order":81,"category":"动态规划","id":"70","title":"爬楼梯","slug":"climbing-stairs","difficulty":"EASY","pattern":"一维滚动 DP","tags":["动态规划","数学"],"summary":"每次爬 1 或 2 阶，求到第 n 阶的方法数。","signal":"最后一步只可能来自 n-1 或 n-2。","invariant":"f(n)=f(n-1)+f(n-2)，只需保留最近两个状态。","steps":["设置 f(1)=1、f(2)=2","从 3 迭代到 n","每次滚动更新前两个值"],"time":"O(n)","space":"O(1)","pitfall":"n=1 要单独覆盖；此题初值与从 0 阶定义时的写法有关。","formula":"f_n=f_{n-1}+f_{n-2}","code":"class Solution:\n    def climbStairs(self, n):\n        if n <= 2:\n            return n\n        previous2, previous1 = 1, 2\n        for _ in range(3, n + 1):\n            previous2, previous1 = previous1, previous1 + previous2\n        return previous1"},{"order":82,"category":"动态规划","id":"118","title":"杨辉三角","slug":"pascals-triangle","difficulty":"EASY","pattern":"逐行递推","tags":["数组","动态规划"],"summary":"生成杨辉三角前 numRows 行。","signal":"每行两端为 1，中间元素由上一行相邻两数之和得到。","invariant":"row[j]=prev[j-1]+prev[j]，其中 1≤j<row_index。","steps":["逐行创建全 1 数组","用上一行填充中间位置","把完成行加入结果"],"time":"O(n²)","space":"O(n²)（结果）","pitfall":"第 i 行长度是 i+1；第一行没有中间元素。","formula":"C(n,k)=C(n-1,k-1)+C(n-1,k)","code":"class Solution:\n    def generate(self, numRows):\n        triangle = []\n        for i in range(numRows):\n            row = [1] * (i + 1)\n            for j in range(1, i):\n                row[j] = triangle[-1][j - 1] + triangle[-1][j]\n            triangle.append(row)\n        return triangle"},{"order":83,"category":"动态规划","id":"198","title":"打家劫舍","slug":"house-robber","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"选与不选滚动 DP","tags":["数组","动态规划"],"summary":"不能偷相邻房屋，求可偷最高金额。","signal":"处理当前房屋时只有偷它或不偷它两种选择。","invariant":"f(i)=max(f(i-1),f(i-2)+nums[i])，分别对应跳过与选择当前房屋。","steps":["维护 prev2 与 prev1","遍历金额计算 current=max(prev1,prev2+x)","滚动更新并返回 prev1"],"time":"O(n)","space":"O(1)","pitfall":"更新顺序要保留旧的 f(i-2)；空数组时结果为 0。","formula":"f_i=\\max(f_{i-1},f_{i-2}+x_i)","code":"class Solution:\n    def rob(self, nums):\n        previous2 = previous1 = 0\n        for money in nums:\n            previous2, previous1 = previous1, max(previous1, previous2 + money)\n        return previous1"},{"order":84,"category":"动态规划","id":"279","title":"完全平方数","slug":"perfect-squares","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"完全背包最小数量","tags":["动态规划","数学"],"summary":"求和为 n 的完全平方数的最少个数。","signal":"每个平方数可无限使用，是求最少物品数的完全背包。","invariant":"dp[x] 表示组成 x 的最少平方数个数；枚举平方数后正序更新可重复使用。","steps":["初始化 dp[0]=0 其余无穷","枚举每个 square≤n","从 square 到 n 正序更新 dp[x]=min(dp[x],dp[x-square]+1)"],"time":"O(n√n)","space":"O(n)","pitfall":"完全背包容量必须正序；也可按 x 外层枚举所有平方数。","formula":"","code":"class Solution:\n    def numSquares(self, n):\n        dp = [0] + [float(\"inf\")] * n\n        square = 1\n        while square * square <= n:\n            value = square * square\n            for total in range(value, n + 1):\n                dp[total] = min(dp[total], dp[total - value] + 1)\n            square += 1\n        return dp[n]"},{"order":85,"category":"动态规划","id":"322","title":"零钱兑换","slug":"coin-change","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"完全背包最短组合","tags":["动态规划","背包"],"summary":"给定不同面额硬币可无限使用，求凑成 amount 的最少硬币数。","signal":"无限取用且求最小个数，是完全背包。","invariant":"dp[x] 是金额 x 的最少硬币数；从可达的 dp[x-coin] 转移。","steps":["dp[0]=0 其余设为 amount+1","枚举硬币并正序遍历金额","更新最小值，最终仍为哨兵则返回 -1"],"time":"O(amount·c)","space":"O(amount)","pitfall":"哨兵要大于任何可能答案；不可达状态不能误返回大数。","formula":"dp[x]=\\min_c(dp[x-c]+1)","code":"class Solution:\n    def coinChange(self, coins, amount):\n        dp = [0] + [amount + 1] * amount\n        for coin in coins:\n            for total in range(coin, amount + 1):\n                dp[total] = min(dp[total], dp[total - coin] + 1)\n        return -1 if dp[amount] == amount + 1 else dp[amount]"},{"order":86,"category":"动态规划","id":"139","title":"单词拆分","slug":"word-break","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"前缀可达 DP","tags":["动态规划","哈希集合"],"summary":"判断字符串能否由字典中的一个或多个单词拼接而成。","signal":"考虑每个前缀是否可被合法拆分，并枚举最后一个单词起点。","invariant":"dp[i] 表示 s[:i] 可拆分；存在 j<i 使 dp[j] 且 s[j:i] 在字典时 dp[i] 为真。","steps":["把字典放入集合","令 dp[0]=True","对每个终点 i 枚举起点 j，命中后提前结束"],"time":"O(n²)","space":"O(n)","pitfall":"dp 下标表示前缀长度，不是字符下标；切片右端 i 不包含。","formula":"dp[i]=\\bigvee_{j<i}(dp[j]\\land s[j:i]\\in D)","code":"class Solution:\n    def wordBreak(self, s, wordDict):\n        words = set(wordDict)\n        dp = [False] * (len(s) + 1)\n        dp[0] = True\n        for end in range(1, len(s) + 1):\n            for start in range(end):\n                if dp[start] and s[start:end] in words:\n                    dp[end] = True\n                    break\n        return dp[-1]"},{"order":87,"category":"动态规划","id":"300","title":"最长递增子序列","slug":"longest-increasing-subsequence","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"耐心排序 tails","tags":["数组","二分查找"],"summary":"求严格递增子序列的最大长度，子序列不必连续。","signal":"维护每种长度的递增子序列能取得的最小结尾，结尾越小越利于扩展。","invariant":"tails[i] 是长度 i+1 的递增子序列最小尾值，因而 tails 单调递增，可二分替换。","steps":["遍历 x 并在 tails 中找第一个 ≥x 的位置","存在则用 x 替换以降低尾值","不存在则追加，最终长度即答案"],"time":"O(n log n)","space":"O(n)","pitfall":"严格递增使用 bisect_left；tails 本身不一定是原数组中的某个真实最优子序列。","formula":"","code":"from bisect import bisect_left\n\nclass Solution:\n    def lengthOfLIS(self, nums):\n        tails = []\n        for x in nums:\n            index = bisect_left(tails, x)\n            if index == len(tails):\n                tails.append(x)\n            else:\n                tails[index] = x\n        return len(tails)"},{"order":88,"category":"动态规划","id":"152","title":"乘积最大子数组","slug":"maximum-product-subarray","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"同时维护最大与最小乘积","tags":["数组","动态规划"],"summary":"求连续子数组的最大乘积。","signal":"负数会让最大值与最小值交换角色，因此不能只保留最大结尾积。","invariant":"以当前位置结尾的 max_prod 和 min_prod 都由 x、旧 max*x、旧 min*x 三者取极值。","steps":["若 x<0 可先交换 max_prod 与 min_prod","分别与 x 自身比较更新","用 max_prod 更新全局答案"],"time":"O(n)","space":"O(1)","pitfall":"更新两个状态时要使用上一轮值，交换写法可避免覆盖。","formula":"","code":"class Solution:\n    def maxProduct(self, nums):\n        maximum = minimum = answer = nums[0]\n        for x in nums[1:]:\n            if x < 0:\n                maximum, minimum = minimum, maximum\n            maximum = max(x, maximum * x)\n            minimum = min(x, minimum * x)\n            answer = max(answer, maximum)\n        return answer"},{"order":89,"category":"动态规划","id":"416","title":"分割等和子集","slug":"partition-equal-subset-sum","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"0-1 背包可达性","tags":["动态规划","背包"],"summary":"判断数组能否分成元素和相等的两个子集。","signal":"总和为奇数必不可行；否则等价于选若干元素恰好凑出 sum/2。","invariant":"dp[s] 表示是否能用已处理元素凑出 s；每个元素只能用一次，所以容量倒序更新。","steps":["计算总和并排除奇数","dp[0]=True","对每个 x 从 target 倒序到 x 更新 dp[s]"],"time":"O(n·sum)","space":"O(sum)","pitfall":"0-1 背包必须倒序，否则同一元素会在本轮被重复使用。","formula":"target=\\frac{\\sum x_i}{2}","code":"class Solution:\n    def canPartition(self, nums):\n        total = sum(nums)\n        if total % 2:\n            return False\n        target = total // 2\n        dp = [True] + [False] * target\n        for x in nums:\n            for value in range(target, x - 1, -1):\n                dp[value] = dp[value] or dp[value - x]\n        return dp[target]"},{"order":90,"category":"动态规划","id":"32","title":"最长有效括号","slug":"longest-valid-parentheses","difficulty":"HARD","pattern":"哨兵下标栈","tags":["栈","动态规划","字符串"],"summary":"求最长连续有效括号子串长度。","signal":"用栈保存尚未匹配的左括号下标，并保留最近无效位置作为长度基线。","invariant":"栈底元素是当前有效区间左边界之前的下标；匹配后长度为 i-stack[-1]。","steps":["栈初始化 [-1]","遇 ( 压下标","遇 ) 先弹栈，若空则压当前下标作新基线，否则更新长度"],"time":"O(n)","space":"O(n)","pitfall":"遇右括号后要先弹再判断空；-1 哨兵保证从 0 开始的有效串长度正确。","formula":"length=i-base","code":"class Solution:\n    def longestValidParentheses(self, s):\n        stack = [-1]\n        answer = 0\n        for i, ch in enumerate(s):\n            if ch == \"(\":\n                stack.append(i)\n            else:\n                stack.pop()\n                if not stack:\n                    stack.append(i)\n                else:\n                    answer = max(answer, i - stack[-1])\n        return answer"},{"order":91,"category":"多维动态规划","id":"62","title":"不同路径","slug":"unique-paths","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"网格路径 DP","tags":["动态规划","矩阵"],"summary":"机器人只能向右或向下，从左上到右下有多少条路径。","signal":"到达一个格子的最后一步只可能来自上方或左方。","invariant":"dp[j] 在更新前是上方路径数，更新后加上 dp[j-1] 的左方路径数。","steps":["初始化一维 dp 全为 1","逐行从第 2 列开始令 dp[j]+=dp[j-1]","最后一个状态即答案"],"time":"O(mn)","space":"O(n)","pitfall":"第一行与第一列只有一种走法，可作为全 1 初值。","formula":"dp_{i,j}=dp_{i-1,j}+dp_{i,j-1}","code":"class Solution:\n    def uniquePaths(self, m, n):\n        dp = [1] * n\n        for _ in range(1, m):\n            for col in range(1, n):\n                dp[col] += dp[col - 1]\n        return dp[-1]"},{"order":92,"category":"多维动态规划","id":"64","title":"最小路径和","slug":"minimum-path-sum","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"网格最小代价 DP","tags":["动态规划","矩阵"],"summary":"从左上到右下只能向右或向下，求路径数字和最小值。","signal":"每格最优代价由上方与左方较小者转移。","invariant":"dp[j] 更新前代表上方最小和，dp[j-1] 代表本行左方最小和。","steps":["用首行累加初始化 dp","逐行处理，首列单独累加","其余位置更新为 min(上,左)+grid[i][j]"],"time":"O(mn)","space":"O(n)","pitfall":"首列没有左侧来源，要单独更新；不要把缺失方向当成 0。","formula":"dp_{i,j}=a_{i,j}+\\min(dp_{i-1,j},dp_{i,j-1})","code":"class Solution:\n    def minPathSum(self, grid):\n        rows, cols = len(grid), len(grid[0])\n        dp = [0] * cols\n        dp[0] = grid[0][0]\n        for col in range(1, cols):\n            dp[col] = dp[col - 1] + grid[0][col]\n        for row in range(1, rows):\n            dp[0] += grid[row][0]\n            for col in range(1, cols):\n                dp[col] = min(dp[col], dp[col - 1]) + grid[row][col]\n        return dp[-1]"},{"order":93,"category":"多维动态规划","id":"5","title":"最长回文子串","slug":"longest-palindromic-substring","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"中心扩展","tags":["字符串","双指针"],"summary":"返回字符串中最长的连续回文子串。","signal":"任何回文都有一个中心；中心可能是字符，也可能是两个字符之间。","invariant":"从中心向两边扩展时，只要字符相等，当前区间就是回文。","steps":["对每个下标分别尝试奇数中心 (i,i) 与偶数中心 (i,i+1)","扩展直到越界或不等","用更长区间更新答案"],"time":"O(n²)","space":"O(1)","pitfall":"扩展函数退出后有效边界是 left+1 与 right-1。","formula":"","code":"class Solution:\n    def longestPalindrome(self, s):\n        best_left = best_right = 0\n        def expand(left, right):\n            while left >= 0 and right < len(s) and s[left] == s[right]:\n                left -= 1\n                right += 1\n            return left + 1, right - 1\n        for center in range(len(s)):\n            for left, right in (expand(center, center), expand(center, center + 1)):\n                if right - left > best_right - best_left:\n                    best_left, best_right = left, right\n        return s[best_left:best_right + 1]"},{"order":94,"category":"多维动态规划","id":"1143","title":"最长公共子序列","slug":"longest-common-subsequence","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"二维序列 DP","tags":["动态规划","字符串"],"summary":"求两个字符串的最长公共子序列长度，字符不要求连续。","signal":"比较两个前缀的最后字符：相同则共同选取，不同则至少舍弃其中一个。","invariant":"dp[i][j] 表示 text1[:i] 与 text2[:j] 的 LCS 长度。","steps":["建立 (m+1)×(n+1) 零表","字符相同从左上角加一","否则取上方与左方较大值"],"time":"O(mn)","space":"O(mn)","pitfall":"子序列可跳过字符，不能用最长公共子串的连续转移。","formula":"dp_{i,j}=\\begin{cases}dp_{i-1,j-1}+1&a_i=b_j\\\\\\max(dp_{i-1,j},dp_{i,j-1})&otherwise\\end{cases}","code":"class Solution:\n    def longestCommonSubsequence(self, text1, text2):\n        rows, cols = len(text1), len(text2)\n        dp = [[0] * (cols + 1) for _ in range(rows + 1)]\n        for i in range(1, rows + 1):\n            for j in range(1, cols + 1):\n                if text1[i - 1] == text2[j - 1]:\n                    dp[i][j] = dp[i - 1][j - 1] + 1\n                else:\n                    dp[i][j] = max(dp[i - 1][j], dp[i][j - 1])\n        return dp[rows][cols]"},{"order":95,"category":"多维动态规划","id":"72","title":"编辑距离","slug":"edit-distance","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"二维操作 DP","tags":["动态规划","字符串"],"summary":"求把 word1 变成 word2 的最少插入、删除、替换次数。","signal":"观察两个前缀末尾；相同无需操作，不同则枚举三种最后操作。","invariant":"dp[i][j] 表示把前 i 个字符变成前 j 个字符的最少操作数。","steps":["初始化空串边界 dp[i][0]=i、dp[0][j]=j","末字符相同取左上","否则取删除、插入、替换三者最小值加一"],"time":"O(mn)","space":"O(mn)","pitfall":"三种来源分别是上、左、左上，含义不要混淆。","formula":"dp_{i,j}=1+\\min(dp_{i-1,j},dp_{i,j-1},dp_{i-1,j-1})","code":"class Solution:\n    def minDistance(self, word1, word2):\n        rows, cols = len(word1), len(word2)\n        dp = [[0] * (cols + 1) for _ in range(rows + 1)]\n        for i in range(rows + 1):\n            dp[i][0] = i\n        for j in range(cols + 1):\n            dp[0][j] = j\n        for i in range(1, rows + 1):\n            for j in range(1, cols + 1):\n                if word1[i - 1] == word2[j - 1]:\n                    dp[i][j] = dp[i - 1][j - 1]\n                else:\n                    dp[i][j] = 1 + min(dp[i - 1][j], dp[i][j - 1], dp[i - 1][j - 1])\n        return dp[rows][cols]"},{"order":96,"category":"技巧","id":"136","title":"只出现一次的数字","slug":"single-number","difficulty":"EASY","pattern":"异或消去成对元素","tags":["数组","位运算"],"summary":"除一个元素出现一次外其余都出现两次，找出单独元素。","signal":"异或满足自反消去且交换结合，不需要排序或哈希表。","invariant":"a⊕a=0，0⊕x=x；所有成对元素异或后只剩单独元素。","steps":["答案初始化为 0","依次与每个数字异或","返回最终结果"],"time":"O(n)","space":"O(1)","pitfall":"位运算异或是 ^，不是幂运算；该技巧依赖其余元素恰好出现两次。","formula":"a\\oplus a=0","code":"class Solution:\n    def singleNumber(self, nums):\n        answer = 0\n        for x in nums:\n            answer ^= x\n        return answer"},{"order":97,"category":"技巧","id":"169","title":"多数元素","slug":"majority-element","difficulty":"EASY","pattern":"Boyer-Moore 摩尔投票","tags":["数组","计数"],"summary":"找出现次数超过 n/2 的元素，题目保证存在。","signal":"多数元素与其他元素两两抵消后仍会剩下。","invariant":"count 为当前候选相对其他元素的净票数；降到 0 时此前片段可整体抵消，下一元素成为新候选。","steps":["count 为 0 时更新候选","当前值等于候选则加一否则减一","遍历结束返回候选"],"time":"O(n)","space":"O(1)","pitfall":"若题目不保证多数元素存在，结束后还需第二遍验证候选频次。","formula":"","code":"class Solution:\n    def majorityElement(self, nums):\n        candidate = None\n        count = 0\n        for x in nums:\n            if count == 0:\n                candidate = x\n            count += 1 if x == candidate else -1\n        return candidate"},{"order":98,"category":"技巧","id":"75","title":"颜色分类","slug":"sort-colors","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"荷兰国旗三指针","tags":["数组","双指针"],"summary":"原地把只含 0、1、2 的数组按颜色排序。","signal":"把数组维护成已放好的 0 区、待处理区和已放好的 2 区。","invariant":"[0,left) 全是 0，[left,i) 全是 1，[i,right] 未处理，(right,n) 全是 2。","steps":["nums[i]=0 时与 left 交换并同时推进","等于 1 只推进 i","等于 2 与 right 交换并收缩 right，但 i 不动"],"time":"O(n)","space":"O(1)","pitfall":"把 2 换到 i 后不能立刻 i++，换来的元素尚未检查。","formula":"","code":"class Solution:\n    def sortColors(self, nums):\n        left = index = 0\n        right = len(nums) - 1\n        while index <= right:\n            if nums[index] == 0:\n                nums[left], nums[index] = nums[index], nums[left]\n                left += 1\n                index += 1\n            elif nums[index] == 1:\n                index += 1\n            else:\n                nums[index], nums[right] = nums[right], nums[index]\n                right -= 1"},{"order":99,"category":"技巧","id":"31","title":"下一个排列","slug":"next-permutation","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"找下降拐点并翻转后缀","tags":["数组","双指针"],"summary":"把数组原地变为字典序紧邻的下一个排列；若已最大则变为最小。","signal":"要做最小幅度增大：从右找第一处可增位置，用后缀中刚好更大的数替换，再让后缀最小。","invariant":"最长非递增后缀已经是该前缀下的最大排列；交换后该后缀仍非递增，反转即可升序。","steps":["从右找首个 nums[i]<nums[i+1]","若存在，从右找首个大于 nums[i] 的数并交换","反转 i+1 到末尾"],"time":"O(n)","space":"O(1)","pitfall":"查找拐点与交换对象都从右侧开始；完全降序时只需整体反转。","formula":"","code":"class Solution:\n    def nextPermutation(self, nums):\n        pivot = len(nums) - 2\n        while pivot >= 0 and nums[pivot] >= nums[pivot + 1]:\n            pivot -= 1\n        if pivot >= 0:\n            successor = len(nums) - 1\n            while nums[successor] <= nums[pivot]:\n                successor -= 1\n            nums[pivot], nums[successor] = nums[successor], nums[pivot]\n        left, right = pivot + 1, len(nums) - 1\n        while left < right:\n            nums[left], nums[right] = nums[right], nums[left]\n            left += 1\n            right -= 1"},{"order":100,"category":"技巧","id":"287","title":"寻找重复数","slug":"find-the-duplicate-number","difficulty":"MEDIUM","pattern":"Floyd 判环映射","tags":["数组","快慢指针"],"summary":"长度 n+1 的数组值域为 [1,n]，不修改数组且常数空间找唯一重复数。","signal":"把下标看作节点、nums[i] 看作 next，重复值造成两个入口指向同一节点，形成带环链表。","invariant":"环入口对应重复数；Floyd 先相遇，再让一指针回起点同步前进可找到入口。","steps":["slow=nums[0]、fast=nums[nums[0]] 直到相遇","finder 从 0 开始","finder 与 slow 每次走一步，再相遇值即重复数"],"time":"O(n)","space":"O(1)","pitfall":"第二阶段 finder 从下标 0 开始而不是 nums[0]；不要把数组值当普通排序问题修改输入。","formula":"","code":"class Solution:\n    def findDuplicate(self, nums):\n        slow = nums[0]\n        fast = nums[nums[0]]\n        while slow != fast:\n            slow = nums[slow]\n            fast = nums[nums[fast]]\n        finder = 0\n        while finder != slow:\n            finder = nums[finder]\n            slow = nums[slow]\n        return finder"}];
